(5015382, 731651, 76430, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot that almost looks like the blue ribbon winner of Wildlife III I think it was.  It doesn''t really look like natural environment though.  There are lights in the background and the fox (?) is far too comfortable with you being so close.  no vote</td>', 'Really nice shot that almost looks like the blue ribbon winner of Wildlife III I think it was.  It doesn''t really look like natural environment though.  There are lights in the background and the fox (?) is far too comfortable with you being so close.  no vote', '2008-10-20 02:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
