(5015390, 732164, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but DNMC.  "For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment."  Not voting</td>', 'Nice shot, but DNMC.  "For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment."  Not voting', '2008-10-20 03:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
