(5015394, 732299, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful coloring and excellent sharpness</td>', 'Beautiful coloring and excellent sharpness', '2008-10-20 03:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015395, 732205, 76430, '<td valign="top">When peacocks go bad.  Scary looking beautiful bird.</td>', 'When peacocks go bad.  Scary looking beautiful bird.', '2008-10-20 03:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015396, 732122, 42601, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture! I Like the menacing look, and the open beak is very challenging in a "Dont mess with me dude.." kinda way. Your processing is well done.</td>', 'Very nice capture! I Like the menacing look, and the open beak is very challenging in a "Dont mess with me dude.." kinda way. Your processing is well done.', '2008-10-20 03:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015397, 731942, 76430, '<td valign="top">OK I''m officially giving up on commenting on "natural environment".  Nice shot.</td>', 'OK I''m officially giving up on commenting on "natural environment".  Nice shot.', '2008-10-20 03:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015398, 732205, 47541, '<td valign="top">I find the colours a bit bright.  Great composition but my first impression was "whoa! where''d I put my sunnies?" ;)<br/> <br/>He looks like a New Zealand peacock too.  A North Island variety if I''m not mistaken.  So, where do we find this type of Peacock? Auckland Zoo? Western Springs? Shapespear park? ;)<br/> <br/>In all seriousness I think that you''ll have trouble passing this off as "wild" as most people will think "She just found one at the local xyz".<br/> <br/>PS: Not voting.</td>', 'I find the colours a bit bright.  Great composition but my first impression was "whoa! where''d I put my sunnies?" ;) He looks like a New Zealand peacock too.  A North Island variety if I''m not mistaken.  So, where do we find this type of Peacock? Auckland Zoo? Western Springs? Shapespear park? ;) In all seriousness I think that you''ll have trouble passing this off as "wild" as most people will think "She just found one at the local xyz". PS: Not voting.', '2008-10-20 03:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
