(5015633, 732247, 90387, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea behind this shot, and love that you got down low and face to face, so to beak. (oops, speak.) I think a just slightly wider depth of field would have brought a tiny bit more of the shot into focus while still clearly separating the front bird from the pack.  Bravo on an interesting and thought provoking shot!</td>', 'I really like the idea behind this shot, and love that you got down low and face to face, so to beak. (oops, speak.) I think a just slightly wider depth of field would have brought a tiny bit more of the shot into focus while still clearly separating the front bird from the pack.  Bravo on an interesting and thought provoking shot!', '2008-10-20 08:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015635, 732094, 90387, '<td valign="top">I really like the unusual perspective you''ve got here.  Not an angle you see very often. My one nit pick would be that I would have liked the tip of the beak to have made it into the shot, but that may have distrubed the balance of things.</td>', 'I really like the unusual perspective you''ve got here.  Not an angle you see very often. My one nit pick would be that I would have liked the tip of the beak to have made it into the shot, but that may have distrubed the balance of things.', '2008-10-20 08:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015638, 732266, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice triangle composition with wonderful tones! I hope it does well! <br/> <br/>I know just where you took this because he was still there when we passed by. I chickened out entering in this challenge! :)</td>', 'Nice triangle composition with wonderful tones! I hope it does well!  I know just where you took this because he was still there when we passed by. I chickened out entering in this challenge! :)', '2008-10-20 08:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015644, 732188, 90387, '<td valign="top">What an amazing shot!  i love that you absolutely filled the frame with action to the point that it''s almost an abstract.  I''m not sure how the voters will feel about the the spot of color, and to be honest I would really like to see this shot in all B&amp;W.  Still, my highest score so far, and definitely a fav!  Great job!</td>', 'What an amazing shot!  i love that you absolutely filled the frame with action to the point that it''s almost an abstract.  I''m not sure how the voters will feel about the the spot of color, and to be honest I would really like to see this shot in all B&W.  Still, my highest score so far, and definitely a fav!  Great job!', '2008-10-20 08:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
