(5015680, 731022, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like  the duplicity of the birds.  The crop is a touch tight.  Nice DOF.</td>', 'I like  the duplicity of the birds.  The crop is a touch tight.  Nice DOF.', '2008-10-20 09:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
