(5015683, 731662, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really a beautiful scene but it''s more about the topography and architecture than the birds.</td>', 'Really a beautiful scene but it''s more about the topography and architecture than the birds.', '2008-10-20 09:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
