(5015694, 731619, 15711, '<td valign="top">They have the funniest faces.  Nice closeup. Terrific focus.</td>', 'They have the funniest faces.  Nice closeup. Terrific focus.', '2008-10-20 09:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015695, 732182, 82064, '<td valign="top">Love those eye lashes! Nice and sharp. I would have cropped the right 1/4 to 1/3 to off-center the deer and make it look like she was just coming out of the brush. Pretty colors.</td>', 'Love those eye lashes! Nice and sharp. I would have cropped the right 1/4 to 1/3 to off-center the deer and make it look like she was just coming out of the brush. Pretty colors.', '2008-10-20 09:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015696, 732230, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOL - love your title.  Wish the bird were a bit more focused.  It seems to be more on the pilon. I like the arch of his wing.</td>', 'LOL - love your title.  Wish the bird were a bit more focused.  It seems to be more on the pilon. I like the arch of his wing.', '2008-10-20 09:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015698, 732247, 82064, '<td valign="top">Cute facial expression. Love those stick legs too. I think I would have cropped some off the left to off-center the subject. Nice image.</td>', 'Cute facial expression. Love those stick legs too. I think I would have cropped some off the left to off-center the subject. Nice image.', '2008-10-20 09:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015700, 732223, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s great.  This looks like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=41337" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">yanko</a> image. :~)</td>', 'Oh that''s great.  This looks like a  yanko image. :~)', '2008-10-20 09:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015701, 732163, 82064, '<td valign="top">Wow - bright, sharp, and powerful!</td>', 'Wow - bright, sharp, and powerful!', '2008-10-20 09:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015703, 732184, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the half shadowed face. Gives it an ominous feel. Love the use of negative space.</td>', 'Love the half shadowed face. Gives it an ominous feel. Love the use of negative space.', '2008-10-20 09:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015709, 732075, 15711, '<td valign="top">Artful approach.  This doesn''t scream wildlife to me but I do like the way you did the DOF, and the composition.</td>', 'Artful approach.  This doesn''t scream wildlife to me but I do like the way you did the DOF, and the composition.', '2008-10-20 09:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015711, 732247, 36382, '<td valign="top">I love this one.</td>', 'I love this one.', '2008-10-20 09:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015712, 732135, 15711, '<td valign="top">Loving the red leaves.  I might''ve cropped off the part at the top right. Nice focus.</td>', 'Loving the red leaves.  I might''ve cropped off the part at the top right. Nice focus.', '2008-10-20 09:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015713, 732016, 82064, '<td valign="top">I like the focus of attention and the sharpness of the ladybug. I think I would have liked it better if the leaves weren''t totally desaturated and had been left with a tint of green. But I love green, so that''s just me :)</td>', 'I like the focus of attention and the sharpness of the ladybug. I think I would have liked it better if the leaves weren''t totally desaturated and had been left with a tint of green. But I love green, so that''s just me :)', '2008-10-20 09:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015714, 732014, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and use of black and white.  I wish the focus were a bit sharper - or maybe I just need more coffee. LOL. 7</td>', 'Love the composition and use of black and white.  I wish the focus were a bit sharper - or maybe I just need more coffee. LOL. 7', '2008-10-20 09:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015716, 732049, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like an adjustment of shadows and highlights created an almost cartoon effect with the background.</td>', 'Looks like an adjustment of shadows and highlights created an almost cartoon effect with the background.', '2008-10-20 09:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015717, 732188, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the look and chaotic feel of this shot.  The selective desat works well.</td>', 'I like the look and chaotic feel of this shot.  The selective desat works well.', '2008-10-20 09:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015718, 732182, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Great colors</td>', 'Nice shot.  Great colors', '2008-10-20 09:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015719, 731651, 15711, '<td valign="top">I was hoping someone would capture a fox.  I just love his face.  Too bad the branch is in the lower left corner.  What a beauty.</td>', 'I was hoping someone would capture a fox.  I just love his face.  Too bad the branch is in the lower left corner.  What a beauty.', '2008-10-20 09:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015720, 732020, 39880, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I like the minimalist look.</td>', 'This is nice.  I like the minimalist look.', '2008-10-20 09:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015721, 731980, 82064, '<td valign="top">What a big body for such a little head! Sharp and clear - nice image.</td>', 'What a big body for such a little head! Sharp and clear - nice image.', '2008-10-20 09:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015723, 731582, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Christmas card. Loving the red berries.</td>', 'Looks like a Christmas card. Loving the red berries.', '2008-10-20 09:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
