(5016170, 731619, 88136, '<td valign="top">cool photo! ahhh i love it! perfect detail, texture is amazing.  i would be so happy to take a photo like this, congrats! top 20 is my guess, good luck</td>', 'cool photo! ahhh i love it! perfect detail, texture is amazing.  i would be so happy to take a photo like this, congrats! top 20 is my guess, good luck', '2008-10-20 14:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
