(5016498, 732186, 67258, '<td valign="top">Superb framing, and the autumn foliage acts as the perfect foil to the deer. The low viewpoint provides the viewer with an intimate viewpoint.</td>', 'Superb framing, and the autumn foliage acts as the perfect foil to the deer. The low viewpoint provides the viewer with an intimate viewpoint.', '2008-10-20 16:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016500, 732201, 68947, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous shot!  Love the colours and the capture of their attention towards the camera!</td>', 'This is a gorgeous shot!  Love the colours and the capture of their attention towards the camera!', '2008-10-20 16:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016504, 731542, 55956, '<td valign="top">comiugate landscape and the wildlife :)</td>', 'comiugate landscape and the wildlife :)', '2008-10-20 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016508, 732118, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an expression!  It almost seems like it''s telling you off! LOL  Great capture....made me smile! 8</td>', 'Wow, what an expression!  It almost seems like it''s telling you off! LOL  Great capture....made me smile! 8', '2008-10-20 16:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016509, 730790, 67258, '<td valign="top">Cute, and the limited colour palette works well.  I love the sharpness of the eyes and whiskers - there is a very endearing and comical quality to this photo.</td>', 'Cute, and the limited colour palette works well.  I love the sharpness of the eyes and whiskers - there is a very endearing and comical quality to this photo.', '2008-10-20 16:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016512, 732140, 68947, '<td valign="top">So cute!!!  Beautiful capture. Love the texture to the bark on the tree as the background!!  It really adds to the picture as a whole! 9</td>', 'So cute!!!  Beautiful capture. Love the texture to the bark on the tree as the background!!  It really adds to the picture as a whole! 9', '2008-10-20 16:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016515, 731651, 55956, '<td valign="top">a good photo but with 3 distracting elements, the two lights on the top side and the brown thing on the lower side. the brown things was impossible remove but the couple of lights could be do without great work. 6</td>', 'a good photo but with 3 distracting elements, the two lights on the top side and the brown thing on the lower side. the brown things was impossible remove but the couple of lights could be do without great work. 6', '2008-10-20 16:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016519, 732188, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  I have tried shots like this before, and never achieved what I had aimed for - you have given me the inspiration to try again.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  I have tried shots like this before, and never achieved what I had aimed for - you have given me the inspiration to try again.', '2008-10-20 16:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016521, 732295, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL...neighborhood bully! :)  They''re so small but, they are powerful, huh?  Love the contrast of the pebble ground as the background.</td>', 'LOL...neighborhood bully! :)  They''re so small but, they are powerful, huh?  Love the contrast of the pebble ground as the background.', '2008-10-20 16:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016522, 731716, 55956, '<td valign="top">great silhouette, I like the colours in the sky. very well done.</td>', 'great silhouette, I like the colours in the sky. very well done.', '2008-10-20 16:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016523, 732202, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful shot.  Love that the berries frame the shot.</td>', 'Really beautiful shot.  Love that the berries frame the shot.', '2008-10-20 16:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016525, 731582, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture - just enough of the habitat to set the Waxwing in its environment and provide additional interest and aesthetic appeal.</td>', 'Excellent capture - just enough of the habitat to set the Waxwing in its environment and provide additional interest and aesthetic appeal.', '2008-10-20 16:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016528, 732113, 68947, '<td valign="top">One of my fave subjects....butterflies.  Nicely shot with the wings in that angle.  It''s an unusual angle to catch them in from the traditional shots.  Very nice. 8</td>', 'One of my fave subjects....butterflies.  Nicely shot with the wings in that angle.  It''s an unusual angle to catch them in from the traditional shots.  Very nice. 8', '2008-10-20 16:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016533, 732010, 67258, '<td valign="top">I love robins, and this one is a real sweetie.  you have certainly got in close and crisp, although I do feel you could have held off on the sharpening a little. Nonetheless, nicely observed.</td>', 'I love robins, and this one is a real sweetie.  you have certainly got in close and crisp, although I do feel you could have held off on the sharpening a little. Nonetheless, nicely observed.', '2008-10-20 16:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016538, 731651, 30982, '<td valign="top">This shows why foxes get called "sly" all the time.  That''s a sly look if I''ve ever seen one!</td>', 'This shows why foxes get called "sly" all the time.  That''s a sly look if I''ve ever seen one!', '2008-10-20 16:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016540, 732279, 67258, '<td valign="top">An intersting photo, and the water looks lovely, but the duck would benefit from just a little more detail.</td>', 'An intersting photo, and the water looks lovely, but the duck would benefit from just a little more detail.', '2008-10-20 16:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016542, 732240, 68947, '<td valign="top">Oooo........love the action of his/her wings!!!  lovely capture!</td>', 'Oooo........love the action of his/her wings!!!  lovely capture!', '2008-10-20 17:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016546, 732117, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!!  He certainly seems to be rather stern, doesn''t he?  (Or she.  I''m clueless as to owl genders.)  Not sure why the eyes are red - flash, maybe? - but that could be fixed in post processing to make them a bit darker.</td>', 'Heh!!  He certainly seems to be rather stern, doesn''t he?  (Or she.  I''m clueless as to owl genders.)  Not sure why the eyes are red - flash, maybe? - but that could be fixed in post processing to make them a bit darker.', '2008-10-20 17:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016547, 731020, 67258, '<td valign="top">How pathetic looking is that?  Well composed, and very appealing.  I wonder if a little more contrast would make it stronger still?</td>', 'How pathetic looking is that?  Well composed, and very appealing.  I wonder if a little more contrast would make it stronger still?', '2008-10-20 17:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
