(5016880, 732122, 75713, '<td valign="top">coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>What makes this an outstanding photo is the b/g color matches the color in the bird and has a very Autumn feeling to it.  Nice catch light in the birds eye.. might have bumped it a bit more and dodged the color in it''s eye, but that is a personal choice.. I like the reflection on the birds beak - nicely photographed.</td>', 'coming back to comment: What makes this an outstanding photo is the b/g color matches the color in the bird and has a very Autumn feeling to it.  Nice catch light in the birds eye.. might have bumped it a bit more and dodged the color in it''s eye, but that is a personal choice.. I like the reflection on the birds beak - nicely photographed.', '2008-10-20 18:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
