(5016989, 731836, 11854, '<td valign="top">ROFL! Points for humor!</td>', 'ROFL! Points for humor!', '2008-10-20 20:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016995, 732281, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great colors in the foliage.  Great pose in the animal and super fur detail.  Very good exposure, considering this may have been full sunlight.  My pick for the top wildlife image.  (10)</td>', 'Great colors in the foliage.  Great pose in the animal and super fur detail.  Very good exposure, considering this may have been full sunlight.  My pick for the top wildlife image.  (10)', '2008-10-20 20:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016997, 732135, 54446, '<td valign="top">I came very close to entering a nearly identical bh lamb image on the rock faces of the Big Thompson Canyon.  (but, chose a different species at the last moment)  Nice capture of the action.  The painterly effect is something of a distraction, but that''s just me.  The animal in its environment is very realistic to me, as I see this scene very often.  I hope to see this as a ribbon winner.  (9)</td>', 'I came very close to entering a nearly identical bh lamb image on the rock faces of the Big Thompson Canyon.  (but, chose a different species at the last moment)  Nice capture of the action.  The painterly effect is something of a distraction, but that''s just me.  The animal in its environment is very realistic to me, as I see this scene very often.  I hope to see this as a ribbon winner.  (9)', '2008-10-20 20:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016998, 732208, 54446, '<td valign="top">I found this to be a compelling image.  Excellent wildlife in its ocean environment.  I also appreciate the composition and use of negative space to throw attention on the subject.  (Could have been just a little more space on the right margin to allow more room to move.)  My hope for you is that this image receives the votes it deserves.  It''s first rate!  (9)</td>', 'I found this to be a compelling image.  Excellent wildlife in its ocean environment.  I also appreciate the composition and use of negative space to throw attention on the subject.  (Could have been just a little more space on the right margin to allow more room to move.)  My hope for you is that this image receives the votes it deserves.  It''s first rate!  (9)', '2008-10-20 20:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5016999, 732181, 91527, '<td valign="top">Awww, he''s cute!  I love the muted colors in this one -- definitely feels like fall.  Beautiful bokeh and sharpness.  My only suggestion would be a tighter crop -- the stump seems more of a focal point than the squirrel does.</td>', 'Awww, he''s cute!  I love the muted colors in this one -- definitely feels like fall.  Beautiful bokeh and sharpness.  My only suggestion would be a tighter crop -- the stump seems more of a focal point than the squirrel does.', '2008-10-20 20:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017001, 732230, 91527, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, I have a secret passion for seagulls...I love this picture!  I think it''s splendid.</td>', 'I have to admit, I have a secret passion for seagulls...I love this picture!  I think it''s splendid.', '2008-10-20 20:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017009, 732262, 11854, '<td valign="top">I love how it always look like they''re running over top of the water. They are such cute birds. Nicely caught!</td>', 'I love how it always look like they''re running over top of the water. They are such cute birds. Nicely caught!', '2008-10-20 20:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017014, 732075, 36382, '<td valign="top">Who would have thought that a shot of the back of a pigeon would be in my top three, but it is.  This is such an evocative picture.  Love it.</td>', 'Who would have thought that a shot of the back of a pigeon would be in my top three, but it is.  This is such an evocative picture.  Love it.', '2008-10-20 20:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017015, 732244, 36382, '<td valign="top">He is so comical looking.  Like this a lot.</td>', 'He is so comical looking.  Like this a lot.', '2008-10-20 20:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017016, 732153, 11854, '<td valign="top">Cute! He kind of looks like he''s getting ready to pick his nose, lol! Nice job with the eyes. The orangutan''s at our zoo have some kind of personality disorder where they hide under a blanket all day.</td>', 'Cute! He kind of looks like he''s getting ready to pick his nose, lol! Nice job with the eyes. The orangutan''s at our zoo have some kind of personality disorder where they hide under a blanket all day.', '2008-10-20 20:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017018, 731880, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors! Nice clarity!</td>', 'Beautiful colors! Nice clarity!', '2008-10-20 20:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017019, 732013, 11854, '<td valign="top">Aawww! So cute!</td>', 'Aawww! So cute!', '2008-10-20 20:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017021, 731598, 11854, '<td valign="top">That''s either a giant bird or a tiny lizard! LOL! Nice catch (both of you)!</td>', 'That''s either a giant bird or a tiny lizard! LOL! Nice catch (both of you)!', '2008-10-20 20:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017023, 732208, 11854, '<td valign="top">They are such sweet looking creatures!! Love the harbor seals! Nicely caught and love how the water looks so silky!</td>', 'They are such sweet looking creatures!! Love the harbor seals! Nicely caught and love how the water looks so silky!', '2008-10-20 20:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
