(5017089, 731583, 75713, '<td valign="top">coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>Getting an eagle in flight is a goal of wildlife photographers - getting one with it''s claws extended and a clear view of the eye makes it even sweeter - great job.</td>', 'coming back to comment: Getting an eagle in flight is a goal of wildlife photographers - getting one with it''s claws extended and a clear view of the eye makes it even sweeter - great job.', '2008-10-20 21:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017090, 732078, 75713, '<td valign="top">coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>love the detail in this pure white bird. excellent exposure, great job getting such crisp focus on it''s feathers.. the b/g is perfect, love the muted reds in the lower left hand side.</td>', 'coming back to comment: love the detail in this pure white bird. excellent exposure, great job getting such crisp focus on it''s feathers.. the b/g is perfect, love the muted reds in the lower left hand side.', '2008-10-20 21:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017091, 731651, 75713, '<td valign="top">coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>Beautiful little fox and an appropriate title given their love of raiding the chicken house :) Nice catch light in it''s eyes - I like the composition, it looks like it is resting it''s snout on the triangle in the bottom left hand corner which fits with it''s sleepy yet watchful eyes .. I think cloning out the white patches about the head of the fox would be helpful as my eyes go there, also, on my monitor, there the space beside the nose of the fox is a little hot - hard to do much about that given the circumstances of the challenge.. not like you can drag the fox into a studio I know.. nicely photographed.</td>', 'coming back to comment: Beautiful little fox and an appropriate title given their love of raiding the chicken house :) Nice catch light in it''s eyes - I like the composition, it looks like it is resting it''s snout on the triangle in the bottom left hand corner which fits with it''s sleepy yet watchful eyes .. I think cloning out the white patches about the head of the fox would be helpful as my eyes go there, also, on my monitor, there the space beside the nose of the fox is a little hot - hard to do much about that given the circumstances of the challenge.. not like you can drag the fox into a studio I know.. nicely photographed.', '2008-10-20 21:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017092, 731582, 75713, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful shot and suits the spirit of the challenge well - the color of the red berry in the bird''s mouth is echoed in the color of the bird''s face.. just a delight on the eye.. great detail in the feathers.. excellent job getting the catch light in it''s eye.. the composition of this photo is strong.. well done</td>', 'Coming back to comment: This is a wonderful shot and suits the spirit of the challenge well - the color of the red berry in the bird''s mouth is echoed in the color of the bird''s face.. just a delight on the eye.. great detail in the feathers.. excellent job getting the catch light in it''s eye.. the composition of this photo is strong.. well done', '2008-10-20 21:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017093, 731727, 36382, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of the water in the foreground.  The birds look good too :)</td>', 'I love the texture of the water in the foreground.  The birds look good too :)', '2008-10-20 21:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
