(5017102, 732247, 5521, '<td valign="top">I love this one. It''s perfect from a technical point of view and the composition is great.  But most of all, it made me smile :)</td>', 'I love this one. It''s perfect from a technical point of view and the composition is great.  But most of all, it made me smile :)', '2008-10-20 21:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
