(5017117, 732135, 75713, '<td valign="top">coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>I really like how the texture/color in the fur blends in with the wall - great natural camouflage for the animal - well exposed shot, great focus - your composition is good, the red flowers a nice touch - getting the glint in the eye is often very difficult and adds so much to the shot.. love the light, the shadow adds interest, great angle .. can''t think of anything to suggest to improve this photo... bumping the score</td>', 'coming back to comment: I really like how the texture/color in the fur blends in with the wall - great natural camouflage for the animal - well exposed shot, great focus - your composition is good, the red flowers a nice touch - getting the glint in the eye is often very difficult and adds so much to the shot.. love the light, the shadow adds interest, great angle .. can''t think of anything to suggest to improve this photo... bumping the score', '2008-10-20 21:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
