(5017586, 731980, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t know this water bird at all - very strange looking with that large crop and small head.  looking forward to finding which country it was taken in.</td>', 'I don''t know this water bird at all - very strange looking with that large crop and small head.  looking forward to finding which country it was taken in.', '2008-10-21 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017594, 732235, 67258, '<td valign="top">Your subject is a good example of urban wildlife.  It looks as though your focus is fine, but there are some strong compression artifacts which has resulted in a substantial loss of detail.  There is also a strange fuziness around the sparrow, and strata in the sky - I suspect that you may benefit from reading the lesson on uploading images to DPC which can be found in the Tutorial section; if you need any further advice, drop me a PM.</td>', 'Your subject is a good example of urban wildlife.  It looks as though your focus is fine, but there are some strong compression artifacts which has resulted in a substantial loss of detail.  There is also a strange fuziness around the sparrow, and strata in the sky - I suspect that you may benefit from reading the lesson on uploading images to DPC which can be found in the Tutorial section; if you need any further advice, drop me a PM.', '2008-10-21 09:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017596, 732205, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well that''s what you call in your face!  Super capture.</td>', 'Well that''s what you call in your face!  Super capture.', '2008-10-21 09:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017598, 732149, 73942, '<td valign="top">wow, great background</td>', 'wow, great background', '2008-10-21 09:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017603, 730572, 73942, '<td valign="top">love the faded edges on this, softens the picture in a nice way</td>', 'love the faded edges on this, softens the picture in a nice way', '2008-10-21 09:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017604, 732252, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nice one!  The glare is a little distracting - not sure if a polariser filter might help in such situations?</td>', 'Nice one!  The glare is a little distracting - not sure if a polariser filter might help in such situations?', '2008-10-21 09:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017675, 732082, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image with great light and detail that really does show off his majesty.  I really couldn''t ask for more in a wildlife shot!</td>', 'Beautiful image with great light and detail that really does show off his majesty.  I really couldn''t ask for more in a wildlife shot!', '2008-10-21 10:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017678, 732247, 65234, '<td valign="top">ROFLOL!  I love this.  My clear favorite in the challenge for humor and storytelling.  Sea Gulls always seem to have attitude in spades and you captured that perfectly using this straight-on perspective and enough DOF to single out the leader of the gang.  The title is icing on the cake.  Well done :-)))</td>', 'ROFLOL!  I love this.  My clear favorite in the challenge for humor and storytelling.  Sea Gulls always seem to have attitude in spades and you captured that perfectly using this straight-on perspective and enough DOF to single out the leader of the gang.  The title is icing on the cake.  Well done :-)))', '2008-10-21 10:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017682, 732135, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  It doesn''t look like there is nearly enough ledge there to support him!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  It doesn''t look like there is nearly enough ledge there to support him!', '2008-10-21 10:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017684, 731868, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cooperative of him to pause in a perfectly framed open area!  Gorgeous beast.</td>', 'Very cooperative of him to pause in a perfectly framed open area!  Gorgeous beast.', '2008-10-21 10:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017699, 731759, 65234, '<td valign="top">The pose here is spectacular!  Absolutely spectacular.  Focus and DOF are spot on.  And before I digress, I voted this a 9.<br/> <br/>But I''m going to nitpick, because the color is striking me oddly.  The delineations feel artificial: the little patch of yellow he''s standing in and then a soldly pinkish field behind and green and yellow in front, with no colors interspersed elsewhere.  The trees in the back appear in clear bands of color.  I don''t know if that''s processing or if it really looked that way, but it just doesn''t appear natural to my eye.  If he wasn''t standing out well enough because of color I would have gone with B&amp;W.  Such a strong image would work well that way IMO.</td>', 'The pose here is spectacular!  Absolutely spectacular.  Focus and DOF are spot on.  And before I digress, I voted this a 9. But I''m going to nitpick, because the color is striking me oddly.  The delineations feel artificial: the little patch of yellow he''s standing in and then a soldly pinkish field behind and green and yellow in front, with no colors interspersed elsewhere.  The trees in the back appear in clear bands of color.  I don''t know if that''s processing or if it really looked that way, but it just doesn''t appear natural to my eye.  If he wasn''t standing out well enough because of color I would have gone with B&W.  Such a strong image would work well that way IMO.', '2008-10-21 10:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017700, 731878, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ah, the icky part of nature: critters eating critters.  Looks like a rather large (and white) field mouse.  Bird is beautifully sharp, as he should be.</td>', 'Ah, the icky part of nature: critters eating critters.  Looks like a rather large (and white) field mouse.  Bird is beautifully sharp, as he should be.', '2008-10-21 10:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017702, 731582, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a cool bird and a perfect story-telling capture!  I can even see his little tongue :-)  A blue sky might have been a better background but really, this is darn close to perfect.</td>', 'What a cool bird and a perfect story-telling capture!  I can even see his little tongue :-)  A blue sky might have been a better background but really, this is darn close to perfect.', '2008-10-21 10:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017706, 732252, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ack!  Now I''ve got that old kiddie song in my head!!!<br/> <br/>Great detail on the frog and fly (hoverfly of some kind?) and nice diagonal composition.  I might try cloning some texture onto the blown bits of the leaf on the top left so it doesn''t draw my eye past the frog.</td>', 'Ack!  Now I''ve got that old kiddie song in my head!!! Great detail on the frog and fly (hoverfly of some kind?) and nice diagonal composition.  I might try cloning some texture onto the blown bits of the leaf on the top left so it doesn''t draw my eye past the frog.', '2008-10-21 10:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017707, 732244, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool heron!  And very windblown.  Hard to hunker down with those long legs, though.  Love the detail on him and the hint of pink at the top of the shot.  It would have been even cooler if he and the gull had more similar poses, but this works for me, too.</td>', 'Cool heron!  And very windblown.  Hard to hunker down with those long legs, though.  Love the detail on him and the hint of pink at the top of the shot.  It would have been even cooler if he and the gull had more similar poses, but this works for me, too.', '2008-10-21 10:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017709, 732297, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene.  Quite serene, if you''re not the fish being consumed ;-)</td>', 'Lovely scene.  Quite serene, if you''re not the fish being consumed ;-)', '2008-10-21 10:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017710, 732075, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great title and pose :-)))  Bonus point for making me smile.</td>', 'Great title and pose :-)))  Bonus point for making me smile.', '2008-10-21 10:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017712, 731988, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on this guy!  Good composition, too.  Still not the prettiest bird, but well-captured ;-)  Is he really that yellow?  I only see storks in zoos so I''m not terribly familiar with the various types.</td>', 'Nice detail on this guy!  Good composition, too.  Still not the prettiest bird, but well-captured ;-)  Is he really that yellow?  I only see storks in zoos so I''m not terribly familiar with the various types.', '2008-10-21 11:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017713, 731548, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh ... ick.  Poor froggy :-(  I know; it''s nature.  And a well-captured scene.</td>', 'Oh ... ick.  Poor froggy :-(  I know; it''s nature.  And a well-captured scene.', '2008-10-21 11:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017715, 731020, 65234, '<td valign="top">He''s so cute!!!  He looks like the little guy who starred with a snail in the Grimms'' Fairy Tale challenge.  Great detail and very engaging expression.</td>', 'He''s so cute!!!  He looks like the little guy who starred with a snail in the Grimms'' Fairy Tale challenge.  Great detail and very engaging expression.', '2008-10-21 11:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017721, 732184, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very striking lighting and astounding detail.  Almost film noir hawk.  I can''t look away from that mesmerizing eye!  I''ll be interested to see your notes on this one; I get these guys in my yard periodically and have gotten a few close shots, but none as intriguing as this.</td>', 'Very striking lighting and astounding detail.  Almost film noir hawk.  I can''t look away from that mesmerizing eye!  I''ll be interested to see your notes on this one; I get these guys in my yard periodically and have gotten a few close shots, but none as intriguing as this.', '2008-10-21 11:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017723, 732203, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  I hope you were using a very long lens ;-)  Very cool action shot.</td>', 'Yikes!  I hope you were using a very long lens ;-)  Very cool action shot.', '2008-10-21 11:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017731, 732294, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the light coming through the wings :-)  Not an easy shot to expose, I''d wager!  I''d try desaturating the parts of the bird with a bluish cast to make him look even more angelic.</td>', 'Love the light coming through the wings :-)  Not an easy shot to expose, I''d wager!  I''d try desaturating the parts of the bird with a bluish cast to make him look even more angelic.', '2008-10-21 11:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017732, 732149, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely little guy with great detail.  Background looks flat as a pancake.</td>', 'Lovely little guy with great detail.  Background looks flat as a pancake.', '2008-10-21 11:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017744, 731727, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of torn on this one.  I like the composition and DOF and the detail on the birds, and the patterns in the foreground ripples.  The yellow ... kind of overwhelms the image.  It''s not a color that complements little brown birds.  But you lose all the drama if you desaturate it and I''m not sure a hue shift would look natural.  Gee, that was helpful, wasn''t it? ;-p</td>', 'I''m kind of torn on this one.  I like the composition and DOF and the detail on the birds, and the patterns in the foreground ripples.  The yellow ... kind of overwhelms the image.  It''s not a color that complements little brown birds.  But you lose all the drama if you desaturate it and I''m not sure a hue shift would look natural.  Gee, that was helpful, wasn''t it? ;-p', '2008-10-21 11:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017749, 732147, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a great little GQ pose :-)  This guy has a future as a model.  I might clone some more detail into the bright leaves in the background.</td>', 'What a great little GQ pose :-)  This guy has a future as a model.  I might clone some more detail into the bright leaves in the background.', '2008-10-21 11:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017752, 732276, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not looking too happy about whatever he''s seeing.  Reminds me of a kid wading into crab-infested water ;-)  Great pose and the reflection adds a lot to the image.  I might try bumping the contrast just a bit.</td>', 'Not looking too happy about whatever he''s seeing.  Reminds me of a kid wading into crab-infested water ;-)  Great pose and the reflection adds a lot to the image.  I might try bumping the contrast just a bit.', '2008-10-21 11:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017753, 732208, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely serene harbor he has to paddle around in.</td>', 'Lovely serene harbor he has to paddle around in.', '2008-10-21 11:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017755, 731309, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.  He does look quite contemplative.</td>', 'Great portrait.  He does look quite contemplative.', '2008-10-21 11:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017763, 732182, 65234, '<td valign="top">My, but she looks alert!  I would tone down the saturation on the greens and yellows so she could better enjoy center stage here.  I might play with cropping tighter, too, though I like the framing you achieved.</td>', 'My, but she looks alert!  I would tone down the saturation on the greens and yellows so she could better enjoy center stage here.  I might play with cropping tighter, too, though I like the framing you achieved.', '2008-10-21 11:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017765, 732262, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great little action shot to illustrate the aptness of his name.</td>', 'Great little action shot to illustrate the aptness of his name.', '2008-10-21 11:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017768, 732205, 65234, '<td valign="top">He looks a bit peeved.  Maybe more than a bit ;-)  Great pose and composition.  Blues, greens and yellows look oversaturated on my monitor.</td>', 'He looks a bit peeved.  Maybe more than a bit ;-)  Great pose and composition.  Blues, greens and yellows look oversaturated on my monitor.', '2008-10-21 11:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017770, 732140, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice squirrel shot :-)  Nice earth tones and a really cool bump in the tree he''s sitting on.</td>', 'Very nice squirrel shot :-)  Nice earth tones and a really cool bump in the tree he''s sitting on.', '2008-10-21 11:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017771, 732298, 65234, '<td valign="top">Contentedly chewing and apparently not at all threatened by a photographer''s interest ;-)  His antlers are getting a little lost in the branches back there; some background-blurring would make him stand out even better.</td>', 'Contentedly chewing and apparently not at all threatened by a photographer''s interest ;-)  His antlers are getting a little lost in the branches back there; some background-blurring would make him stand out even better.', '2008-10-21 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017772, 732088, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great face :-)  Very nice detail and clean composition.</td>', 'Great face :-)  Very nice detail and clean composition.', '2008-10-21 11:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017775, 732233, 65234, '<td valign="top">So true!  The blacktop here looks a bit magenta; maybe this needs a white balance adjustment?</td>', 'So true!  The blacktop here looks a bit magenta; maybe this needs a white balance adjustment?', '2008-10-21 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017776, 732142, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty duck!  I love the teal on her wing and the similar color of the water, and that is one strong reflection.</td>', 'Pretty duck!  I love the teal on her wing and the similar color of the water, and that is one strong reflection.', '2008-10-21 11:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017780, 732078, 65234, '<td valign="top">He''s pouffed!  I don''t usually see them quite this compact ;-)  Nice detail and the red in the background is a beautiful complement to the white.</td>', 'He''s pouffed!  I don''t usually see them quite this compact ;-)  Nice detail and the red in the background is a beautiful complement to the white.', '2008-10-21 11:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017783, 732015, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can''t say as I care for the cyan hue.  You''ve got nice detail here but the color is just not doing anything for me.</td>', 'I can''t say as I care for the cyan hue.  You''ve got nice detail here but the color is just not doing anything for me.', '2008-10-21 11:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017790, 732248, 60495, '<td valign="top">I love this shot except for the awkwardness of the balance the crop makes, to me I may have liked it better if there was more space on the left to balance the negative space on the right but hey that''s just me. The part of the shot I really love is the B&amp;W tones and the textures which are very well done.</td>', 'I love this shot except for the awkwardness of the balance the crop makes, to me I may have liked it better if there was more space on the left to balance the negative space on the right but hey that''s just me. The part of the shot I really love is the B&W tones and the textures which are very well done.', '2008-10-21 11:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017797, 732188, 60495, '<td valign="top">Very busy shot but I could see this one enlarged hanging on a wall, smaller image size really does not do justice to this kind of shot.</td>', 'Very busy shot but I could see this one enlarged hanging on a wall, smaller image size really does not do justice to this kind of shot.', '2008-10-21 11:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017801, 732214, 60495, '<td valign="top">Shows up a little dark on my screen but I like the setting and can see why you could be walking right up on him before you see him. Nice capture.</td>', 'Shows up a little dark on my screen but I like the setting and can see why you could be walking right up on him before you see him. Nice capture.', '2008-10-21 12:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017815, 732264, 60495, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like you captured this one in the wild!</td>', 'Wow, looks like you captured this one in the wild!', '2008-10-21 12:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017837, 732088, 94265, '<td valign="top">Haha I love his expression! He totally looks like he''s scowling at you. Nice capture, I like the neutral background.</td>', 'Haha I love his expression! He totally looks like he''s scowling at you. Nice capture, I like the neutral background.', '2008-10-21 12:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017840, 731548, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Nice and clear and no OOF on the frog. Looks a touch blown out under his chin but it serves to enhance his eye.</td>', 'Nice capture! Nice and clear and no OOF on the frog. Looks a touch blown out under his chin but it serves to enhance his eye.', '2008-10-21 12:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017843, 732205, 94265, '<td valign="top">Brilliant capture on the expression and those colours are just fantastic.</td>', 'Brilliant capture on the expression and those colours are just fantastic.', '2008-10-21 12:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017844, 731663, 94265, '<td valign="top">Uh oh it''s a bug, DNMC, DNMC!!! Just joking, hehe. The colour and focus here are brilliant, great job, a 9.</td>', 'Uh oh it''s a bug, DNMC, DNMC!!! Just joking, hehe. The colour and focus here are brilliant, great job, a 9.', '2008-10-21 12:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017845, 731309, 94265, '<td valign="top">He''s beautiful, the light on his face is perfect. Great focus too.</td>', 'He''s beautiful, the light on his face is perfect. Great focus too.', '2008-10-21 12:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5017846, 731728, 94265, '<td valign="top">Wow those colours are something else! Beautiful.</td>', 'Wow those colours are something else! Beautiful.', '2008-10-21 12:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
