(5018005, 731880, 35994, '<td valign="top">Wow! Talk about some gorgeous reflections!!! I expect to see this in the top 10. Really nice focus on the bird, looks like his beak might be a bit OOF but what can you do with wildlife, they don''t always listen like they''re supposed to!</td>', 'Wow! Talk about some gorgeous reflections!!! I expect to see this in the top 10. Really nice focus on the bird, looks like his beak might be a bit OOF but what can you do with wildlife, they don''t always listen like they''re supposed to!', '2008-10-21 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018007, 732150, 35994, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, love the colors. Not sure if it was found in the wild, if it was that''s awesome! I''d love to sneak up on something like this!</td>', 'Really nice shot, love the colors. Not sure if it was found in the wild, if it was that''s awesome! I''d love to sneak up on something like this!', '2008-10-21 14:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
