(5018015, 732273, 35994, '<td valign="top">IMO DOF seems just a tad off, the tip of his nose seems to be a little oof, could just be my eyes though. Nice colors &amp; a neat pose! I''m curious to see if this was found in it''s nature habitat, will check back after voting is finished :)</td>', 'IMO DOF seems just a tad off, the tip of his nose seems to be a little oof, could just be my eyes though. Nice colors & a neat pose! I''m curious to see if this was found in it''s nature habitat, will check back after voting is finished :)', '2008-10-21 14:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018020, 732295, 88136, '<td valign="top">focus seems too shallow or something, the only part of the bird that looks really focused is his shoulder</td>', 'focus seems too shallow or something, the only part of the bird that looks really focused is his shoulder', '2008-10-21 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018024, 731836, 88136, '<td valign="top">what a pretty bird, lovely capture of both the water droplets on his head and from his beak. great color as well, and i like the motion in the water as well</td>', 'what a pretty bird, lovely capture of both the water droplets on his head and from his beak. great color as well, and i like the motion in the water as well', '2008-10-21 14:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018028, 732046, 88136, '<td valign="top">wow, look at that emotion you captured in her eyes! amazing! if she had been looking into the camera like that the lens might have exploded lol. i love the texture of their coats, good positioning as well</td>', 'wow, look at that emotion you captured in her eyes! amazing! if she had been looking into the camera like that the lens might have exploded lol. i love the texture of their coats, good positioning as well', '2008-10-21 14:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018031, 731868, 88136, '<td valign="top">ah this has great potential.  too bad the buck is fuzzy, and you dont have a sunrise and mountains in the background lol. all im saying is this could be the front of a book or movie. what a cool moment</td>', 'ah this has great potential.  too bad the buck is fuzzy, and you dont have a sunrise and mountains in the background lol. all im saying is this could be the front of a book or movie. what a cool moment', '2008-10-21 14:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
