(5018051, 732297, 88136, '<td valign="top">wow, this is awesome.  looks like a seafood restaurant''s menu cover or something for some reason.  i love the colors and the blues of the water mixed with the golds.  Your timing just worked perfect here, congrats!-8</td>', 'wow, this is awesome.  looks like a seafood restaurant''s menu cover or something for some reason.  i love the colors and the blues of the water mixed with the golds.  Your timing just worked perfect here, congrats!-8', '2008-10-21 14:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
