(5018357, 732169, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice straight forward capture of an everyday bird that we can all too easily take foregranted. <br/> <br/>If it had not been for his friend I would have cropped it at the ''V'' just under his feet and made it a square crop with him as the star. On the other hand I quite like the diagonal they form across the screen, and having two of them does give a greater feeling of depth . .</td>', 'Nice straight forward capture of an everyday bird that we can all too easily take foregranted.  If it had not been for his friend I would have cropped it at the ''V'' just under his feet and made it a square crop with him as the star. On the other hand I quite like the diagonal they form across the screen, and having two of them does give a greater feeling of depth . .', '2008-10-21 16:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
