(5018375, 732062, 68586, '<td valign="top">For some reason the unhelpful thought that pops into my mind is from Sylvester and Tweetiepie . .<br/> <br/>" I thort I thaw a Puddy cat shneaking up on me . . "  lol<br/> <br/>I would be very worried if this one was heading anywhere near me. Is it a lynx ?<br/> <br/>Anyway - nice shot and good surroundings, ideally a lower Pov would have made this even more powerful, but hey - that''s life  :- )</td>', 'For some reason the unhelpful thought that pops into my mind is from Sylvester and Tweetiepie . . " I thort I thaw a Puddy cat shneaking up on me . . "  lol I would be very worried if this one was heading anywhere near me. Is it a lynx ? Anyway - nice shot and good surroundings, ideally a lower Pov would have made this even more powerful, but hey - that''s life  :- )', '2008-10-21 16:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
