(5018546, 730790, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely wonderful.  I''ve not made it very far through the challenge yet, but I suspect this may well be my favorite even after I finish voting.  "May I have some more?" or "Hello, I''m wondering if you''re interested in purchasing some life insurance."  Just delightful!  The post processing is lovely with the slight acidic tones.<br/>OK, it''s official.  I''m done voting, and this is still my favorite of the challenge!</td>', 'This is absolutely wonderful.  I''ve not made it very far through the challenge yet, but I suspect this may well be my favorite even after I finish voting.  "May I have some more?" or "Hello, I''m wondering if you''re interested in purchasing some life insurance."  Just delightful!  The post processing is lovely with the slight acidic tones.OK, it''s official.  I''m done voting, and this is still my favorite of the challenge!', '2008-10-21 16:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018547, 732248, 30982, '<td valign="top">Novel angle and really nice stark processing!</td>', 'Novel angle and really nice stark processing!', '2008-10-21 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
