(5018706, 732062, 16912, '<td valign="top">ok, if I were a gambling man I''d wager a few quid on this being a zoo shot lol (you''ll understand if your reading the rather depressing scores thread).<br/> <br/>Anyway, let me know if I''m right (post challenge is fine). My sole 10 vote in the challenge (might bump a little weekend). No, its not a purrfect shot but pretty darn close with the full frame, stride, concentration on the cat and the general feel of stalking pray.<br/> <br/>Best of luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'ok, if I were a gambling man I''d wager a few quid on this being a zoo shot lol (you''ll understand if your reading the rather depressing scores thread). Anyway, let me know if I''m right (post challenge is fine). My sole 10 vote in the challenge (might bump a little weekend). No, its not a purrfect shot but pretty darn close with the full frame, stride, concentration on the cat and the general feel of stalking pray. Best of luck in the challenge :)', '2008-10-21 17:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
