(5018743, 732262, 7810, '<td valign="top">A nice composition and good capture</td>', 'A nice composition and good capture', '2008-10-21 18:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018745, 732283, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gregarious things, aren''t they?  Catching one in flight is a nice addition to the image.  Focus looks sharpest on the reflection under the big group instead of any of the birds themselves, so a little more DOF might have been better to get all the birds in focus, or focus on one (maybe the landing one) and let the others drop out of focus a little.</td>', 'Gregarious things, aren''t they?  Catching one in flight is a nice addition to the image.  Focus looks sharpest on the reflection under the big group instead of any of the birds themselves, so a little more DOF might have been better to get all the birds in focus, or focus on one (maybe the landing one) and let the others drop out of focus a little.', '2008-10-21 18:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018746, 731942, 7810, '<td valign="top">Great image well processed ... good luck</td>', 'Great image well processed ... good luck', '2008-10-21 18:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018749, 731728, 7810, '<td valign="top">Strong colours and clarity ... maybe a tad over saturated but good  nonetheless</td>', 'Strong colours and clarity ... maybe a tad over saturated but good  nonetheless', '2008-10-21 18:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018751, 732232, 68586, '<td valign="top">Aaaargh !! It''s found ''Nemo'' and is eating him !!<br/> <br/>Call the Coastguard.</td>', 'Aaaargh !! It''s found ''Nemo'' and is eating him !! Call the Coastguard.', '2008-10-21 18:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018753, 732182, 7810, '<td valign="top">Nice capture ... very Yanko like ... love the composition/framing</td>', 'Nice capture ... very Yanko like ... love the composition/framing', '2008-10-21 18:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018754, 732164, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite the macro, especially given the proximity to Halloweentime.  Photographically I would prefer more DOF; the OOF legs bother me a little.  I think I''d like maybe a slightly different angle, so the web and legs were sharp and then focus fell off as the eye wandered to more of the spider.<br/> <br/>Also (here it comes!) a bug isn''t going to get my highest vote in this challenge, given the description and the competition.</td>', 'Quite the macro, especially given the proximity to Halloweentime.  Photographically I would prefer more DOF; the OOF legs bother me a little.  I think I''d like maybe a slightly different angle, so the web and legs were sharp and then focus fell off as the eye wandered to more of the spider. Also (here it comes!) a bug isn''t going to get my highest vote in this challenge, given the description and the competition.', '2008-10-21 18:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018755, 732109, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute perspective.  Lighting looks rather flat and I would have preferred some background context to add depth.</td>', 'Cute perspective.  Lighting looks rather flat and I would have preferred some background context to add depth.', '2008-10-21 18:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
