(5018758, 731490, 65234, '<td valign="top">I think he''s eating.  Clearly I have no sense of imagination ;-)  Lighting is dramatic which doesn''t really suit the mundane activity IMO.</td>', 'I think he''s eating.  Clearly I have no sense of imagination ;-)  Lighting is dramatic which doesn''t really suit the mundane activity IMO.', '2008-10-21 18:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
