(5018765, 732235, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can see good detail on the Sparrow''s eye, but the shot feels quite soft overall and I''m seeing some odd pixellation around the bird''s outline.  Sharpening artifact, maybe?  Composition is OK but I might have played with including the bird''s shadow, if he held still for a few more pictures, just to add some more interest to the shot.  And desaturated the blue tinge to the shadow.</td>', 'I can see good detail on the Sparrow''s eye, but the shot feels quite soft overall and I''m seeing some odd pixellation around the bird''s outline.  Sharpening artifact, maybe?  Composition is OK but I might have played with including the bird''s shadow, if he held still for a few more pictures, just to add some more interest to the shot.  And desaturated the blue tinge to the shadow.', '2008-10-21 18:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018809, 732149, 7810, '<td valign="top">Nice Warbler love the shallow DOF</td>', 'Nice Warbler love the shallow DOF', '2008-10-21 19:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
