(5021276, 732274, 80096, '<td valign="top">I like the tiger facing us but I wish the angle of the shot was different so that you weren''t looking at the back of the second tiger''s head. You can''t really see what the other tiger is doing. The facing tiger''s expression and paw w/claws showing are great. I would have burned out the grass/leaves in the background in order to draw more attention to the animal. Overall a 6.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-27 11:18:44.</i></td>', 'I like the tiger facing us but I wish the angle of the shot was different so that you weren''t looking at the back of the second tiger''s head. You can''t really see what the other tiger is doing. The facing tiger''s expression and paw w/claws showing are great. I would have burned out the grass/leaves in the background in order to draw more attention to the animal. Overall a 6.', '2008-10-22 23:09:54.000000', '2008-10-27 11:18:44.000000', 1),
