(5021638, 731759, 87538, '<td valign="top">I believe you have ruined an otherwise awesome shot. The image is no longer real. It feels more like a painting instead of a captured image.</td>', 'I believe you have ruined an otherwise awesome shot. The image is no longer real. It feels more like a painting instead of a captured image.', '2008-10-23 01:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
