(5022140, 732147, 35994, '<td valign="top">Wow, how did you sneak up on that guy to get such a candid shot?? Great detail, nice reflection in the eye.</td>', 'Wow, how did you sneak up on that guy to get such a candid shot?? Great detail, nice reflection in the eye.', '2008-10-23 13:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022143, 731765, 35994, '<td valign="top">Neat capture, I like the leaves in the front of him, they work as a nice border. Nice detail in his skin too.</td>', 'Neat capture, I like the leaves in the front of him, they work as a nice border. Nice detail in his skin too.', '2008-10-23 13:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022145, 732072, 35994, '<td valign="top">Neat!! I''ve never seen a deer as he was losing the velvet off his antlers.</td>', 'Neat!! I''ve never seen a deer as he was losing the velvet off his antlers.', '2008-10-23 13:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022146, 732144, 35994, '<td valign="top">How cute is he!! I really like the crop.</td>', 'How cute is he!! I really like the crop.', '2008-10-23 13:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022396, 732248, 67258, '<td valign="top">This bold photo is an interesting take on the challenge.  The perspective works well, and I love the way the pelican (?) stares at the viewer - the intensity is superb.  I am undecided about the one sidedness of the image - on balance I feel I would have preferred more balance with the lighting, but at the same time I do appreciate the boldness.</td>', 'This bold photo is an interesting take on the challenge.  The perspective works well, and I love the way the pelican (?) stares at the viewer - the intensity is superb.  I am undecided about the one sidedness of the image - on balance I feel I would have preferred more balance with the lighting, but at the same time I do appreciate the boldness.', '2008-10-23 17:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022398, 732193, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is a bizarre surrealistic sense to this - in all honesty, I can;t really decide what I make of it...</td>', 'There is a bizarre surrealistic sense to this - in all honesty, I can;t really decide what I make of it...', '2008-10-23 17:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022402, 732247, 67258, '<td valign="top">Simply wonderful!</td>', 'Simply wonderful!', '2008-10-23 17:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022404, 731882, 67258, '<td valign="top">Thoroughly impessive!</td>', 'Thoroughly impessive!', '2008-10-23 17:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022411, 732262, 67258, '<td valign="top">Some type of plover?  A super study of the bird, which really gives me a feel of its'' nature.</td>', 'Some type of plover?  A super study of the bird, which really gives me a feel of its'' nature.', '2008-10-23 17:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022417, 732244, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is wonderful!</td>', 'Oh, this is wonderful!', '2008-10-23 17:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022418, 732220, 67258, '<td valign="top">Pretty damn cool!</td>', 'Pretty damn cool!', '2008-10-23 17:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022444, 732277, 67258, '<td valign="top">These are somewhat similar to the ubiquitous European starling - a good take on the challenge; I particularly like the way the the conversational birds are sitting on a telephone line!</td>', 'These are somewhat similar to the ubiquitous European starling - a good take on the challenge; I particularly like the way the the conversational birds are sitting on a telephone line!', '2008-10-23 17:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022453, 731987, 67258, '<td valign="top">I do feel that this might have been stronger if it hadn''t been framed quite so tightly; in particular, I find the cut off ears rather awkward.  There are a number of ''spots'' where the detail appears missing, which I do find somwaht distracting.</td>', 'I do feel that this might have been stronger if it hadn''t been framed quite so tightly; in particular, I find the cut off ears rather awkward.  There are a number of ''spots'' where the detail appears missing, which I do find somwaht distracting.', '2008-10-23 17:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022457, 732113, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful butterfly!  Here in England I have seen so few this summer, so it is lovely seeing photos of them!  i appreciate the way you have included the plant to give context, but in this instance, I do feel that the composition could be strengthened by cropping a little more from the top.</td>', 'What a wonderful butterfly!  Here in England I have seen so few this summer, so it is lovely seeing photos of them!  i appreciate the way you have included the plant to give context, but in this instance, I do feel that the composition could be strengthened by cropping a little more from the top.', '2008-10-23 17:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
