(5023273, 731878, 94265, '<td valign="top">There''s so few of these gorgeous birds left in Scotland, it''s really nice for me to see a good clear shot of one. The focus is really good. Don''t you just love those stripey long shorts he wears? :)</td>', 'There''s so few of these gorgeous birds left in Scotland, it''s really nice for me to see a good clear shot of one. The focus is really good. Don''t you just love those stripey long shorts he wears? :)', '2008-10-24 11:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
