(5023278, 732233, 56254, '<td valign="top">I find the car lights slightly distracting as the brightest object in the frame .. fantastic capture though ... love the fall colors .... 8</td>', 'I find the car lights slightly distracting as the brightest object in the frame .. fantastic capture though ... love the fall colors .... 8', '2008-10-24 11:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023281, 732153, 56254, '<td valign="top">love that expression ... great capture!</td>', 'love that expression ... great capture!', '2008-10-24 11:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023284, 732294, 66353, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture :)</td>', 'Beautiful picture :)', '2008-10-24 11:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023286, 732082, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think this one turned out brilliantly, I hope it does well :)</td>', 'I think this one turned out brilliantly, I hope it does well :)', '2008-10-24 11:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023287, 732223, 94265, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see something a bit different in the challenge, wasn''t expecting to see an armadillo. The DOF is great and the sharpness on his textures is brilliant.</td>', 'It''s nice to see something a bit different in the challenge, wasn''t expecting to see an armadillo. The DOF is great and the sharpness on his textures is brilliant.', '2008-10-24 11:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023290, 730806, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal, beautiful shot. It really shows off his gorgeous colour and markings.</td>', 'Beautiful animal, beautiful shot. It really shows off his gorgeous colour and markings.', '2008-10-24 11:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023291, 731836, 94265, '<td valign="top">That shimmering green looks fantastic. Great sharpness.</td>', 'That shimmering green looks fantastic. Great sharpness.', '2008-10-24 11:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023292, 731928, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus. Beautiful bird.</td>', 'I like the soft focus. Beautiful bird.', '2008-10-24 11:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023327, 732015, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot of a very handsome tiger, the focus is good and I love the close crop. I don''t feel the green adds much to the shot, personally I''d rather have seen him in his proper orange glory. Some green patchiness has leaked into his eyes too, which spoils them a bit. I wonder if you upped the green to hide reflections if he was shot behind glass? Still, if this <b>is</b> a glass shot, it''s a very well done one.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot of a very handsome tiger, the focus is good and I love the close crop. I don''t feel the green adds much to the shot, personally I''d rather have seen him in his proper orange glory. Some green patchiness has leaked into his eyes too, which spoils them a bit. I wonder if you upped the green to hide reflections if he was shot behind glass? Still, if this is a glass shot, it''s a very well done one.', '2008-10-24 12:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023328, 732297, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love the silhouette look, it''s still clear enough to see what it is but it allows for more attention to be paid to the beautiful colours on the water.</td>', 'I love the silhouette look, it''s still clear enough to see what it is but it allows for more attention to be paid to the beautiful colours on the water.', '2008-10-24 12:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023330, 732281, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve ever seen one of these before. He looks like he''s wearing a helmet! I love that he''s centred amongst those lovely coloured plants.</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve ever seen one of these before. He looks like he''s wearing a helmet! I love that he''s centred amongst those lovely coloured plants.', '2008-10-24 12:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023331, 732135, 94265, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect but I think I''d have prefered it without that warped look. As it is, the composition is good and those bursts of red dotted around really add something extra to this. I''m not exactly sure what kind of goat/deer this is but it sure is cute.</td>', 'Interesting effect but I think I''d have prefered it without that warped look. As it is, the composition is good and those bursts of red dotted around really add something extra to this. I''m not exactly sure what kind of goat/deer this is but it sure is cute.', '2008-10-24 12:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023335, 732109, 94265, '<td valign="top">I might have liked this a wee bit more if it were rotated slightly. It''s quite a pleasant, comical shot, along with the title. Very cute and the crop is good. I like that the background is blown out, makes his tan colours stand out more.</td>', 'I might have liked this a wee bit more if it were rotated slightly. It''s quite a pleasant, comical shot, along with the title. Very cute and the crop is good. I like that the background is blown out, makes his tan colours stand out more.', '2008-10-24 12:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023362, 732075, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is really amazing.  I love the single word yet play on words title.  I love the rule of thirds, and everything is in just the right place for me.  Great b/w too.  My only 10!</td>', 'This is really amazing.  I love the single word yet play on words title.  I love the rule of thirds, and everything is in just the right place for me.  Great b/w too.  My only 10!', '2008-10-24 13:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023364, 731727, 52500, '<td valign="top">I expect this to ribbon.  It exudes perfect DPCness.  Well done.</td>', 'I expect this to ribbon.  It exudes perfect DPCness.  Well done.', '2008-10-24 13:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023365, 732252, 52500, '<td valign="top">The light/processing seems kinda harsh to me, but it still looks awesome.  Nice capture, too!</td>', 'The light/processing seems kinda harsh to me, but it still looks awesome.  Nice capture, too!', '2008-10-24 13:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023366, 732223, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice one, Yanko.  Great tones as usual.</td>', 'Nice one, Yanko.  Great tones as usual.', '2008-10-24 13:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023370, 731716, 52500, '<td valign="top">I''ve decided I''m a sucker for a good silhouette.  Nice one!</td>', 'I''ve decided I''m a sucker for a good silhouette.  Nice one!', '2008-10-24 13:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023475, 732108, 35994, '<td valign="top">IMHO this owl looks like it is stuffed &amp; in an exhibit. A nice shot, don''t get me wrong, just not sure if it meets the challenge. Not going to vote, best of luck! (not to mention I don''t haven''t translated the title)</td>', 'IMHO this owl looks like it is stuffed & in an exhibit. A nice shot, don''t get me wrong, just not sure if it meets the challenge. Not going to vote, best of luck! (not to mention I don''t haven''t translated the title)', '2008-10-24 14:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023495, 732297, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a superb silhouette!</td>', 'What a superb silhouette!', '2008-10-24 14:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023497, 732184, 85451, '<td valign="top">I love how the shot if so very different from the typical bird shot. I''ll be giving this a 9, well done. Oh hell I changed my vote to a 10.</td>', 'I love how the shot if so very different from the typical bird shot. I''ll be giving this a 9, well done. Oh hell I changed my vote to a 10.', '2008-10-24 14:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023502, 731838, 67258, '<td valign="top">Certainly a magnificent animal, and you have clearly managed to get very close.  The woodland in the background provides good context, but I do find the composition slightly awkward - its all subjective, but I would probably have pulled back somewhat to get more of the stag into the frame.</td>', 'Certainly a magnificent animal, and you have clearly managed to get very close.  The woodland in the background provides good context, but I do find the composition slightly awkward - its all subjective, but I would probably have pulled back somewhat to get more of the stag into the frame.', '2008-10-24 14:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023503, 732117, 85451, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, I would have tried to clean it up more since it is advanced editing.</td>', 'Neat shot, I would have tried to clean it up more since it is advanced editing.', '2008-10-24 14:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023505, 732014, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a lovely photo!  You have retained a real sense of delicacy.</td>', 'What a lovely photo!  You have retained a real sense of delicacy.', '2008-10-24 14:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023544, 731533, 95137, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this composition, shame portions of his head got overexposed</td>', 'I like the idea behind this composition, shame portions of his head got overexposed', '2008-10-24 15:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023547, 730892, 95137, '<td valign="top">Well captured deer, but the foreground is a little too distracting for me</td>', 'Well captured deer, but the foreground is a little too distracting for me', '2008-10-24 15:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023548, 732078, 95137, '<td valign="top">Well captured, would be even better if it had more space to look into on the LHS</td>', 'Well captured, would be even better if it had more space to look into on the LHS', '2008-10-24 15:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023549, 731728, 95137, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours and beautifully captured</td>', 'Gorgeous colours and beautifully captured', '2008-10-24 15:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023564, 732134, 67723, '<td valign="top">wow that''s some short grass for being in the wild, or either that cat crept into human civilization.  Or maybe it was taken at a zoo...</td>', 'wow that''s some short grass for being in the wild, or either that cat crept into human civilization.  Or maybe it was taken at a zoo...', '2008-10-24 15:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023567, 731937, 67723, '<td valign="top">firebird?  I don''t understand the title... possibly a nickname I don''t know.  Zany processing</td>', 'firebird?  I don''t understand the title... possibly a nickname I don''t know.  Zany processing', '2008-10-24 15:29:47.000000', NULL, 1);
