(5024319, 732235, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and looks like a good shot but you have used way too much compression when you have resized and saved, the photo can be 150kb and you have 15kb so maybe a mistype?<br/> <br/>Try saving at 75% quality or 20% compression depending on what software you are using. Also, have a look under learn as you will find some useful info there</td>', 'Nice composition and looks like a good shot but you have used way too much compression when you have resized and saved, the photo can be 150kb and you have 15kb so maybe a mistype? Try saving at 75% quality or 20% compression depending on what software you are using. Also, have a look under learn as you will find some useful info there', '2008-10-25 05:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5024332, 732232, 66616, '<td valign="top">too much noise</td>', 'too much noise', '2008-10-25 06:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5024386, 730790, 61961, '<td valign="top">Perhaps my favorite challenge photo, the only thing preventing me from bumping this to a "10" is that your subject is not a more traditional form of wildlife.</td>', 'Perhaps my favorite challenge photo, the only thing preventing me from bumping this to a "10" is that your subject is not a more traditional form of wildlife.', '2008-10-25 09:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5024459, 730790, 68586, '<td valign="top">A squirrel that''s been Lens Babied ??<br/> <br/>Really good effect here - looks very 3D ! and nice matching muted tones. <br/> <br/>Very very good.<br/> <br/>I suspect this will do either really well with the voters or really badly - and I don''t know which . . <br/> <br/>But I hope it does well !<br/> <br/>Just come back to fav this - sadly I''m not voting in this challenge, but if I was this would be straight into my shortlist</td>', 'A squirrel that''s been Lens Babied ?? Really good effect here - looks very 3D ! and nice matching muted tones.  Very very good. I suspect this will do either really well with the voters or really badly - and I don''t know which . .  But I hope it does well ! Just come back to fav this - sadly I''m not voting in this challenge, but if I was this would be straight into my shortlist', '2008-10-25 11:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
