(5025109, 732203, 39057, '<td valign="top">Obviously a zoo shot. If this would have been in the wild, you would have been attacked. Also...the goat and the background are almost the same color.  Hanging up a blue sheet with some clouds painted on it behind the goat would have made this a much better shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-27 10:01:37.</i></td>', 'Obviously a zoo shot. If this would have been in the wild, you would have been attacked. Also...the goat and the background are almost the same color.  Hanging up a blue sheet with some clouds painted on it behind the goat would have made this a much better shot.', '2008-10-26 00:23:44.000000', '2008-10-27 10:01:37.000000', 1),
(5025196, 731582, 97614, '<td valign="top">What a great picture!!</td>', 'What a great picture!!', '2008-10-26 01:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025205, 732288, 60195, '<td valign="top">very unique.  I love the tones, the DoF, &amp; the striking silhouette.  One of my top picks.  Well done!</td>', 'very unique.  I love the tones, the DoF, & the striking silhouette.  One of my top picks.  Well done!', '2008-10-26 01:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025207, 731727, 37673, '<td valign="top">I came back to this a day later and adjusted your score. It went up in case your wondering. Maybe I''ll check it again tomorrow and go up even further...<br/>It''s a very nice shot and I love the colors. I would have tried to make the green pop a bit more than it''s current state. Beautiful composition. Actually after writing my critique I''m adding another point because a few things came to light after closer look. Congrats on your 8</td>', 'I came back to this a day later and adjusted your score. It went up in case your wondering. Maybe I''ll check it again tomorrow and go up even further...It''s a very nice shot and I love the colors. I would have tried to make the green pop a bit more than it''s current state. Beautiful composition. Actually after writing my critique I''m adding another point because a few things came to light after closer look. Congrats on your 8', '2008-10-26 01:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025244, 731619, 96915, '<td valign="top">I love the detail, but not so much the halo around the bird''s head.  Either this was oversharpened, or there was some HDR done on it, either way the halo is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I love the detail, but not so much the halo around the bird''s head.  Either this was oversharpened, or there was some HDR done on it, either way the halo is a bit distracting.', '2008-10-26 02:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025245, 732188, 96915, '<td valign="top">I like the point of color.</td>', 'I like the point of color.', '2008-10-26 02:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025259, 732205, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great expression captured.</td>', 'Great expression captured.', '2008-10-26 04:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025295, 731919, 77192, '<td valign="top">Not may favourite creature in the world but a good shot. Love the backlighting.</td>', 'Not may favourite creature in the world but a good shot. Love the backlighting.', '2008-10-26 06:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025296, 732248, 77192, '<td valign="top">Not keen on this PP at all :-(</td>', 'Not keen on this PP at all :-(', '2008-10-26 06:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
