(5025299, 732206, 77192, '<td valign="top">I can feel his breath from here!</td>', 'I can feel his breath from here!', '2008-10-26 06:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025300, 732230, 77192, '<td valign="top">LOL for the title!</td>', 'LOL for the title!', '2008-10-26 06:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025321, 732252, 86799, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Great shot, too.</td>', 'Love the title.  Great shot, too.', '2008-10-26 07:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025347, 732108, 67258, '<td valign="top">This image fascinates me - i have returned to view many times over the last week.  From a technical perspective the lighting and composition intrigue me.  The scale seems wrong, with blades of grass and leaves out of proportion to the trees that appear in front of them.  Disregarding that, there is a real fairytale fantasy feel to the photo which I find rather appealing.</td>', 'This image fascinates me - i have returned to view many times over the last week.  From a technical perspective the lighting and composition intrigue me.  The scale seems wrong, with blades of grass and leaves out of proportion to the trees that appear in front of them.  Disregarding that, there is a real fairytale fantasy feel to the photo which I find rather appealing.', '2008-10-26 08:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025349, 731886, 67258, '<td valign="top">The intensity of expression that you have captured so well combined with the crisp focus really makes this.  I am less sure about your choice of dof - it falls off a little too rapidly for my tastes and has resulted in a rather decapitated feeling.</td>', 'The intensity of expression that you have captured so well combined with the crisp focus really makes this.  I am less sure about your choice of dof - it falls off a little too rapidly for my tastes and has resulted in a rather decapitated feeling.', '2008-10-26 08:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025350, 732301, 67258, '<td valign="top">I have tried similar shots with limited success - much harder than they look. Yours works well, although it is a slight shame that there is a little more space to the left for the cockatoo (?) to fly/land in to.</td>', 'I have tried similar shots with limited success - much harder than they look. Yours works well, although it is a slight shame that there is a little more space to the left for the cockatoo (?) to fly/land in to.', '2008-10-26 08:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025351, 732062, 67258, '<td valign="top">An appealing photo with good expression and pose, lighting, and compositional elements.  Bit of a shame the paw to the left is cut off, but nonetheless, a strong photo.</td>', 'An appealing photo with good expression and pose, lighting, and compositional elements.  Bit of a shame the paw to the left is cut off, but nonetheless, a strong photo.', '2008-10-26 08:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025352, 731619, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2008-10-26 08:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025354, 731878, 67258, '<td valign="top">Field mice are clearly a lot larger in your country than in mine!  That aside, an interesting photo showing animal behaviour - a bit of a shame that the talons and tail are cut off.</td>', 'Field mice are clearly a lot larger in your country than in mine!  That aside, an interesting photo showing animal behaviour - a bit of a shame that the talons and tail are cut off.', '2008-10-26 08:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025356, 732201, 67258, '<td valign="top">A super family portrait, with the animals set within the context of their natural environment.  The dramatic lighting adds real interest.</td>', 'A super family portrait, with the animals set within the context of their natural environment.  The dramatic lighting adds real interest.', '2008-10-26 08:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025364, 730726, 67258, '<td valign="top">A very pretty photo.</td>', 'A very pretty photo.', '2008-10-26 08:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025365, 732150, 67258, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh, but that aside a pleasing autumnal scene.</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh, but that aside a pleasing autumnal scene.', '2008-10-26 08:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025373, 731880, 67258, '<td valign="top">On golden pond! The water and reflection are wonderful - my only criticism, and it is slight, is that I find the photo just a little too centered.</td>', 'On golden pond! The water and reflection are wonderful - my only criticism, and it is slight, is that I find the photo just a little too centered.', '2008-10-26 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025376, 732182, 67258, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite of the many deer entries - you have retained the feeling of a surprise encounter, of naturalness, whilst getting close, something I was unable to do.  If the oof leaves across the animal were missing, it would have been a 10 from me, as is a strong 8. Really, very impressive.</td>', 'One of my favourite of the many deer entries - you have retained the feeling of a surprise encounter, of naturalness, whilst getting close, something I was unable to do.  If the oof leaves across the animal were missing, it would have been a 10 from me, as is a strong 8. Really, very impressive.', '2008-10-26 08:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025377, 731583, 67258, '<td valign="top">Expertly photographed - throughly impressive.</td>', 'Expertly photographed - throughly impressive.', '2008-10-26 08:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025379, 732169, 67258, '<td valign="top">I have visited this a few times this week, and like it more eachtime.  The composition is what makes this, with the gentle echo of the second bird.</td>', 'I have visited this a few times this week, and like it more eachtime.  The composition is what makes this, with the gentle echo of the second bird.', '2008-10-26 08:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025380, 731937, 67258, '<td valign="top">The vignette is a little strong for my tastes, but nonetheless a fine entry.</td>', 'The vignette is a little strong for my tastes, but nonetheless a fine entry.', '2008-10-26 08:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025382, 732203, 67258, '<td valign="top">A very unusual perspective - how close were you? You and camera obviously survived the encounter!</td>', 'A very unusual perspective - how close were you? You and camera obviously survived the encounter!', '2008-10-26 08:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025383, 731728, 67258, '<td valign="top">The sense of serenity is strong here, with the duck quietly hiding close to the reeds.  Very nice.</td>', 'The sense of serenity is strong here, with the duck quietly hiding close to the reeds.  Very nice.', '2008-10-26 08:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025389, 732147, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very good, love the colors.</td>', 'Very good, love the colors.', '2008-10-26 09:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025391, 732140, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great shot, good clarity and colors.</td>', 'Great shot, good clarity and colors.', '2008-10-26 09:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025410, 731886, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Excellent image. I hope it is wildlife as I''m giving you a good score ;-)</td>', 'Wonderful. Excellent image. I hope it is wildlife as I''m giving you a good score ;-)', '2008-10-26 09:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025412, 732277, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and clarity.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and clarity.', '2008-10-26 09:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025415, 732135, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great. This is one of my favourites for top 3.</td>', 'Wow! Great. This is one of my favourites for top 3.', '2008-10-26 09:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025422, 732153, 52549, '<td valign="top">I love this, it''s a absolutely beautiful image (even if it is a zoo pic ;-)</td>', 'I love this, it''s a absolutely beautiful image (even if it is a zoo pic ;-)', '2008-10-26 10:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025439, 731548, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a capture!</td>', 'What a capture!', '2008-10-26 10:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025441, 732149, 67258, '<td valign="top">A super study of this little bird.</td>', 'A super study of this little bird.', '2008-10-26 10:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025442, 732288, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a find - and what vision to create this stunning photo.</td>', 'What a find - and what vision to create this stunning photo.', '2008-10-26 10:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025445, 732075, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is a photo that appeals to me enormously.  It is almost as though there is nobody but me the viewer and this pigeon in the whole world - hard to articulate, perhaps I should leave trying, and just say a photo that leaves an impression.</td>', 'This is a photo that appeals to me enormously.  It is almost as though there is nobody but me the viewer and this pigeon in the whole world - hard to articulate, perhaps I should leave trying, and just say a photo that leaves an impression.', '2008-10-26 10:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025446, 732294, 67258, '<td valign="top">The back light illuminating the wing feathers is stunning, and your control of exposure thoroughly impressive.  Excellent work.</td>', 'The back light illuminating the wing feathers is stunning, and your control of exposure thoroughly impressive.  Excellent work.', '2008-10-26 10:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025447, 731727, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing photo - interesting and with aesthetic appeal, too.</td>', 'Very pleasing photo - interesting and with aesthetic appeal, too.', '2008-10-26 10:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025466, 730572, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely little bird with a great catchlight in his eye.  He looks suspicious.  Not sure I like the fading border, especially as his tail seems to have been caught in it, although it''s possible there were some OOF leaves along the bottom of the shot creating that ghosty look.  I usually try to fix that by burning and cloning when it''s this subtle.</td>', 'Lovely little bird with a great catchlight in his eye.  He looks suspicious.  Not sure I like the fading border, especially as his tail seems to have been caught in it, although it''s possible there were some OOF leaves along the bottom of the shot creating that ghosty look.  I usually try to fix that by burning and cloning when it''s this subtle.', '2008-10-26 10:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025470, 732122, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like his tongue is a suspension bridge with those long bits of yellow whatever in there.  Nice detail on the eyes.  Overall cast seems a little yellow/orange to me, like the image needs a white balance adjustment.</td>', 'Looks like his tongue is a suspension bridge with those long bits of yellow whatever in there.  Nice detail on the eyes.  Overall cast seems a little yellow/orange to me, like the image needs a white balance adjustment.', '2008-10-26 10:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025473, 730790, 65234, '<td valign="top">It''s Oliver Twist Squirrel:  "Please, sir, I want some more."  The eye contact is ridiculously endearing; I just love this pose!  The processing works well, too, although there is a bit of white near his tail on the left/bottom that looks like some sort of intestinal worm (sorry for that thought) which I would have cloned/blurred out of existence.</td>', 'It''s Oliver Twist Squirrel:  "Please, sir, I want some more."  The eye contact is ridiculously endearing; I just love this pose!  The processing works well, too, although there is a bit of white near his tail on the left/bottom that looks like some sort of intestinal worm (sorry for that thought) which I would have cloned/blurred out of existence.', '2008-10-26 11:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025476, 731583, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow; he''s really popping out of this shot!  He looks a little blurry in places, like some sort of noise reduction was needed, but that fierce eye is beautifully sharp.</td>', 'Wow; he''s really popping out of this shot!  He looks a little blurry in places, like some sort of noise reduction was needed, but that fierce eye is beautifully sharp.', '2008-10-26 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025480, 732299, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, a little Mandarin Duckie :-)  Very cool birds.  Nice capture with his beak in the water and very clear reflection of his eye.  Don''t know what I think about that very yellow-green water ... I probably would have desaturated it a lot so the duck stood out better.</td>', 'Aw, a little Mandarin Duckie :-)  Very cool birds.  Nice capture with his beak in the water and very clear reflection of his eye.  Don''t know what I think about that very yellow-green water ... I probably would have desaturated it a lot so the duck stood out better.', '2008-10-26 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025483, 732186, 65234, '<td valign="top">Mmm, twigs!  Nicely framed by the trees.  The deer would stand out just a bit better with a white balance adjustment to make him browner, some blurring of the biger black branches just OOF behind him and some dodging on the antlers IMO.</td>', 'Mmm, twigs!  Nicely framed by the trees.  The deer would stand out just a bit better with a white balance adjustment to make him browner, some blurring of the biger black branches just OOF behind him and some dodging on the antlers IMO.', '2008-10-26 11:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025485, 732201, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice little trio.  Vignetting looks a little heavy to me but they do stand out well.</td>', 'Nice little trio.  Vignetting looks a little heavy to me but they do stand out well.', '2008-10-26 11:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025486, 732117, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great expression but those red reflections are off-putting to me.  Personally, I always fix them with a red-eye tool or desaturation or something to get them to look natural.</td>', 'Great expression but those red reflections are off-putting to me.  Personally, I always fix them with a red-eye tool or desaturation or something to get them to look natural.', '2008-10-26 11:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025551, 732174, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, with lovely wing position, and delightful background colours.</td>', 'Nice capture, with lovely wing position, and delightful background colours.', '2008-10-26 12:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025552, 732172, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great patterns in the water !</td>', 'Great patterns in the water !', '2008-10-26 12:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025553, 732122, 68586, '<td valign="top">A good crop and nice close capture. <br/> <br/>I think there is a lot of potential in here that might have been brought out with additional post processing.<br/> <br/>Is it a Harris Hawk ?</td>', 'A good crop and nice close capture.  I think there is a lot of potential in here that might have been brought out with additional post processing. Is it a Harris Hawk ?', '2008-10-26 12:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025554, 731533, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - there is somtheing wonderfully prehistoric about Turtles and Tortoises up close.<br/> <br/>This might have benefitted from a little more DoF so that his whole face was in focus ?</td>', 'Nice idea - there is somtheing wonderfully prehistoric about Turtles and Tortoises up close. This might have benefitted from a little more DoF so that his whole face was in focus ?', '2008-10-26 12:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025564, 730790, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. The post processing looks great and the wee guy almost looks like he''s standing begging for a nut. At first I wondered if he was a stuffed squirrel, as this would be a pretty damn difficult shot to get otherwise but his eyes look real. Very cute either way and great focus/sharpness on his face.</td>', 'I love this shot. The post processing looks great and the wee guy almost looks like he''s standing begging for a nut. At first I wondered if he was a stuffed squirrel, as this would be a pretty damn difficult shot to get otherwise but his eyes look real. Very cute either way and great focus/sharpness on his face.', '2008-10-26 12:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025565, 732016, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love ladybird shots, the focus is really good on her and the DOF is spot on. The selective desat is really effective.</td>', 'I love ladybird shots, the focus is really good on her and the DOF is spot on. The selective desat is really effective.', '2008-10-26 12:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025566, 732230, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice pose you''ve caught with no blur, great contrast too. Good focus all over.</td>', 'Nice pose you''ve caught with no blur, great contrast too. Good focus all over.', '2008-10-26 12:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025569, 732014, 94265, '<td valign="top">The bird almost looks like an oil painting. This might''ve been from a lot of sharpening or something but it looks good. Would''ve liked to have seen him in colour too but at the same time, if he''s a common sparrow like I think he might be, his brown colouring might not have brought much oomph to the photo. I like the centering.</td>', 'The bird almost looks like an oil painting. This might''ve been from a lot of sharpening or something but it looks good. Would''ve liked to have seen him in colour too but at the same time, if he''s a common sparrow like I think he might be, his brown colouring might not have brought much oomph to the photo. I like the centering.', '2008-10-26 12:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025570, 732208, 94265, '<td valign="top">That perfectly smooth water looks awesome. Even though only a fraction of his face is showing, it''s still a great shot because of the clear grey water and those big brown eyes.</td>', 'That perfectly smooth water looks awesome. Even though only a fraction of his face is showing, it''s still a great shot because of the clear grey water and those big brown eyes.', '2008-10-26 12:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025571, 732075, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective on this and the title is pretty clever. I''m just waiting for him to take off!</td>', 'I love the perspective on this and the title is pretty clever. I''m just waiting for him to take off!', '2008-10-26 12:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025572, 731886, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, she is a stunning creature. The focus on the face is really good.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, she is a stunning creature. The focus on the face is really good.', '2008-10-26 12:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025574, 732273, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful greens, really eye-catching. That one strip of bright green above his head is a wee bit distracting. The sharpness on the texture is great.</td>', 'Beautiful greens, really eye-catching. That one strip of bright green above his head is a wee bit distracting. The sharpness on the texture is great.', '2008-10-26 12:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025575, 732078, 94265, '<td valign="top">It''s not easy to photograph something all white and not lose all the detail, in my experience. Good job keeping the feathers defined.</td>', 'It''s not easy to photograph something all white and not lose all the detail, in my experience. Good job keeping the feathers defined.', '2008-10-26 12:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025577, 730726, 94265, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the very edges of the wings aren''t in focus but it doesn''t detract from the beauty of the shot; it looks good that she''s sitting on a cream flower and those greens are so soft and mellow. Makes this a very calming picture.</td>', 'It''s a shame the very edges of the wings aren''t in focus but it doesn''t detract from the beauty of the shot; it looks good that she''s sitting on a cream flower and those greens are so soft and mellow. Makes this a very calming picture.', '2008-10-26 12:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025578, 731582, 94265, '<td valign="top">Some lovely use of colour here; the red berries, that lovely peachy-tan cheek and the little splash of yellow on the tail. Really pretty shot.</td>', 'Some lovely use of colour here; the red berries, that lovely peachy-tan cheek and the little splash of yellow on the tail. Really pretty shot.', '2008-10-26 12:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025581, 732142, 94265, '<td valign="top">Brilliant focus on the wet feathers, really good sharp detail. I like that one little patch of blue on the wing, it matches the water ripples.</td>', 'Brilliant focus on the wet feathers, really good sharp detail. I like that one little patch of blue on the wing, it matches the water ripples.', '2008-10-26 13:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025582, 732135, 67258, '<td valign="top">The shadow lifts this from a good photo to something really rather special.  Excellent work.</td>', 'The shadow lifts this from a good photo to something really rather special.  Excellent work.', '2008-10-26 13:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025583, 732153, 94265, '<td valign="top">Judging by the softness on his hands and hair, I''d be inclined to think this was shot through glass but if so, you''ve done a good job pulling forth the details and textures on his face. His expression is pretty comical too! I think I''d have upped the red hue just a little, to really enhance the colour of his fur.</td>', 'Judging by the softness on his hands and hair, I''d be inclined to think this was shot through glass but if so, you''ve done a good job pulling forth the details and textures on his face. His expression is pretty comical too! I think I''d have upped the red hue just a little, to really enhance the colour of his fur.', '2008-10-26 13:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025585, 731583, 94265, '<td valign="top">The yellow really leaps out at you from the clear blue background. I like the soft smoothness of the tail and right wing, it''s almost like a watercolour painting.</td>', 'The yellow really leaps out at you from the clear blue background. I like the soft smoothness of the tail and right wing, it''s almost like a watercolour painting.', '2008-10-26 13:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025587, 731045, 94265, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame you couldn''t have moved that branch out of the way but at least it doesn''t cover up her face. The focus is really good, specially on the nose and the golden fur on her back and neck.</td>', 'It''s a shame you couldn''t have moved that branch out of the way but at least it doesn''t cover up her face. The focus is really good, specially on the nose and the golden fur on her back and neck.', '2008-10-26 13:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025588, 732181, 67258, '<td valign="top">I long to see a red squirrel - here in England the red squirrel population has been decimated by a virus brought  in by the alien grey squirrel.  Ironically the grey squirrel, whilst a carrier, is immune to the virus allowing it to become by far and away the dominant species.<br/>Back to the photo - this is a lovely study.  Your choice of doF is spot on, isolating the squirrel whilst still showing enough of the woodland background to provide environmental context.  I am really pleased you didn''t crop or zoom in too close.</td>', 'I long to see a red squirrel - here in England the red squirrel population has been decimated by a virus brought  in by the alien grey squirrel.  Ironically the grey squirrel, whilst a carrier, is immune to the virus allowing it to become by far and away the dominant species.Back to the photo - this is a lovely study.  Your choice of doF is spot on, isolating the squirrel whilst still showing enough of the woodland background to provide environmental context.  I am really pleased you didn''t crop or zoom in too close.', '2008-10-26 13:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025589, 732181, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love red squirrel shots since there''s so few of them left in Scotland, I never get to see any in the wild. This one is very cute, the focus is really clear, especially on the tail. Good composition too.</td>', 'I love red squirrel shots since there''s so few of them left in Scotland, I never get to see any in the wild. This one is very cute, the focus is really clear, especially on the tail. Good composition too.', '2008-10-26 13:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025590, 732082, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light that you have utilised well.</td>', 'Wonderful light that you have utilised well.', '2008-10-26 13:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025591, 731662, 67258, '<td valign="top">An unusual take on the challenge, but it works well for me.</td>', 'An unusual take on the challenge, but it works well for me.', '2008-10-26 13:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025592, 731490, 94265, '<td valign="top">The light and contrast in this shot are gorgeous and the focus on the wallaby is excellent; only thing I''d want different is a speck of light in the eye to define it more.</td>', 'The light and contrast in this shot are gorgeous and the focus on the wallaby is excellent; only thing I''d want different is a speck of light in the eye to define it more.', '2008-10-26 13:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025593, 732203, 94265, '<td valign="top">You''re very brave I must say, I''d not have been anywhere near this scene! Great capture.</td>', 'You''re very brave I must say, I''d not have been anywhere near this scene! Great capture.', '2008-10-26 13:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025596, 731759, 67258, '<td valign="top">Simms?  Wonderful composition and technicals, and the bellowing stag couldn''t be a better subject, but I am somewhat unsure whether I really like the processing style.  I have revisited this a number of times and my vote hovers between 7 and 10 - so I shall go for 9....</td>', 'Simms?  Wonderful composition and technicals, and the bellowing stag couldn''t be a better subject, but I am somewhat unsure whether I really like the processing style.  I have revisited this a number of times and my vote hovers between 7 and 10 - so I shall go for 9....', '2008-10-26 13:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025597, 732094, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super graphic image that is very pleasing to view.</td>', 'Super graphic image that is very pleasing to view.', '2008-10-26 13:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025598, 732174, 67258, '<td valign="top">Simply wonderful!</td>', 'Simply wonderful!', '2008-10-26 13:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025599, 731868, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love how the focus seems to be on those lovely spots on his body, the light is hitting him really nicely. I like the overhanging tree, it brings another point of interest to the shot but doesn''t take away from the main subject.</td>', 'I love how the focus seems to be on those lovely spots on his body, the light is hitting him really nicely. I like the overhanging tree, it brings another point of interest to the shot but doesn''t take away from the main subject.', '2008-10-26 13:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025600, 730572, 67258, '<td valign="top">The soft vignette adds to the feeling of delicacy and sweetness.  I like it.</td>', 'The soft vignette adds to the feeling of delicacy and sweetness.  I like it.', '2008-10-26 13:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025601, 732062, 94265, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful cat. The sharpness on her is really good, especially the ears and face.</td>', 'What a beautiful cat. The sharpness on her is really good, especially the ears and face.', '2008-10-26 13:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025603, 732252, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love your title, really made me chuckle! I like the processing, it''s so sharp and the colours are fantastic.</td>', 'I love your title, really made me chuckle! I like the processing, it''s so sharp and the colours are fantastic.', '2008-10-26 13:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025606, 730790, 62187, '<td valign="top">This little guy is soooooo cute to me - it''s like he has some human quality to his/her expression. I love it. The focus whether done in camera or in photoshop is very cool. I like the dull/drab colors: 10</td>', 'This little guy is soooooo cute to me - it''s like he has some human quality to his/her expression. I love it. The focus whether done in camera or in photoshop is very cool. I like the dull/drab colors: 10', '2008-10-26 13:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025607, 731651, 94265, '<td valign="top">Could this be an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=46177" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ivory</a> shot? Beautiful, the fox is gorgeous and that focused expression makes the shot pop. I like the soft look too.</td>', 'Could this be an  Ivory shot? Beautiful, the fox is gorgeous and that focused expression makes the shot pop. I like the soft look too.', '2008-10-26 13:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025634, 731663, 51747, '<td valign="top">I would have voted this higher but since it''s  technically an insect, I am posting a lower vote. It is a nice image.  5</td>', 'I would have voted this higher but since it''s  technically an insect, I am posting a lower vote. It is a nice image.  5', '2008-10-26 13:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025635, 731759, 51747, '<td valign="top">It''ll be hard to beat this one. Very nice capture and processing.</td>', 'It''ll be hard to beat this one. Very nice capture and processing.', '2008-10-26 13:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025636, 732188, 51747, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2008-10-26 13:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025637, 732163, 51747, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2008-10-26 13:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025639, 732078, 51747, '<td valign="top">You almost nailed it!! Just a bit more details in the feathers and this would have been a 10</td>', 'You almost nailed it!! Just a bit more details in the feathers and this would have been a 10', '2008-10-26 13:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025640, 732062, 51747, '<td valign="top">Awesome</td>', 'Awesome', '2008-10-26 13:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025641, 732203, 51747, '<td valign="top">good capture. Pretty amazing how the Elk blend in with the surroundings.</td>', 'good capture. Pretty amazing how the Elk blend in with the surroundings.', '2008-10-26 13:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025642, 732088, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice focus. The lighting is a little harsh but you can''t do much about that.</td>', 'Nice focus. The lighting is a little harsh but you can''t do much about that.', '2008-10-26 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025643, 732149, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice capture in spite of the harsh light.</td>', 'Nice capture in spite of the harsh light.', '2008-10-26 13:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025644, 731584, 51747, '<td valign="top">The silhouette works really well with the shadow in this image</td>', 'The silhouette works really well with the shadow in this image', '2008-10-26 13:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025646, 732010, 51747, '<td valign="top">The bird looks great. The background is nicely out of focus but pretty noisy.</td>', 'The bird looks great. The background is nicely out of focus but pretty noisy.', '2008-10-26 13:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025647, 731988, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2008-10-26 13:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025648, 732244, 51747, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF</td>', 'Good use of DOF', '2008-10-26 13:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025649, 732208, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2008-10-26 13:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025650, 731765, 51747, '<td valign="top">Great point of view. He looks like he could be enormous!</td>', 'Great point of view. He looks like he could be enormous!', '2008-10-26 13:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025651, 731583, 51747, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of selective filtering.</td>', 'Interesting use of selective filtering.', '2008-10-26 13:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025652, 731548, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Nice light. Good capture</td>', 'Nice image. Nice light. Good capture', '2008-10-26 13:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025653, 732201, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effect.</td>', 'Nice lighting effect.', '2008-10-26 13:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025654, 732136, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2008-10-26 13:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025660, 732184, 51747, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the negative space.</td>', 'Love the lighting and the negative space.', '2008-10-26 13:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025661, 732248, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice processing.</td>', 'Nice processing.', '2008-10-26 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025662, 732269, 51747, '<td valign="top">One extra point for the laugh.</td>', 'One extra point for the laugh.', '2008-10-26 14:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025664, 731542, 51747, '<td valign="top">I like the processing.</td>', 'I like the processing.', '2008-10-26 14:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025668, 731880, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus. The golden reflection is awesome!</td>', 'Nice sharp focus. The golden reflection is awesome!', '2008-10-26 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025671, 731714, 51747, '<td valign="top">Good exposure on the swan and the dark waters contrast nicely. Not a fan of the border.</td>', 'Good exposure on the swan and the dark waters contrast nicely. Not a fan of the border.', '2008-10-26 14:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025672, 731490, 51747, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. It took me a while to get used to the lighting but now I like it.</td>', 'Interesting idea. It took me a while to get used to the lighting but now I like it.', '2008-10-26 14:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025675, 732297, 51747, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful sunset. Plus you composed the other elements nicely. The bird with the fish is a huge stroke of luck. It MAKES the picture!</td>', 'What a beautiful sunset. Plus you composed the other elements nicely. The bird with the fish is a huge stroke of luck. It MAKES the picture!', '2008-10-26 14:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025676, 732286, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very pretty</td>', 'Very pretty', '2008-10-26 14:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025678, 732231, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp clear focus.</td>', 'Nice crisp clear focus.', '2008-10-26 14:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025680, 732039, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the water drops.</td>', 'Nice capture of the water drops.', '2008-10-26 14:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025682, 732252, 51747, '<td valign="top">Little did it know...</td>', 'Little did it know...', '2008-10-26 14:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025683, 731928, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Just a little dark.</td>', 'Nice image. Just a little dark.', '2008-10-26 14:13:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5025685, 732082, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice background. It looks like you used a reflector on him.</td>', 'Nice background. It looks like you used a reflector on him.', '2008-10-26 14:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025686, 731649, 51747, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool capture. Nice exposure on the heron.</td>', 'Pretty cool capture. Nice exposure on the heron.', '2008-10-26 14:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025687, 732153, 51747, '<td valign="top">Humorous. Made me smile!</td>', 'Humorous. Made me smile!', '2008-10-26 14:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025689, 732049, 51747, '<td valign="top">Freaky vegetation. The rule of 3rds works here.</td>', 'Freaky vegetation. The rule of 3rds works here.', '2008-10-26 14:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025692, 732172, 51747, '<td valign="top">It is a nice abstract. Just a little tighter crop to focus more on the ''Wildlife'' might make this better for the challenge.</td>', 'It is a nice abstract. Just a little tighter crop to focus more on the ''Wildlife'' might make this better for the challenge.', '2008-10-26 14:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025697, 731727, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and captured.</td>', 'Nicely composed and captured.', '2008-10-26 14:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025698, 731937, 51747, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting idea. The title fits the image.</td>', 'It''s an interesting idea. The title fits the image.', '2008-10-26 14:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025699, 731651, 51747, '<td valign="top">I immediately thought of ''Sly like a Fox'' when I saw this. Nice image except the lower left part of the image which I assume you couldn''t do anything about.</td>', 'I immediately thought of ''Sly like a Fox'' when I saw this. Nice image except the lower left part of the image which I assume you couldn''t do anything about.', '2008-10-26 14:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025702, 732193, 51747, '<td valign="top">Good job making the swan stand out.</td>', 'Good job making the swan stand out.', '2008-10-26 14:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025704, 732186, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice image. The colorful leaves are a nice back drop for the Buck.</td>', 'Nice image. The colorful leaves are a nice back drop for the Buck.', '2008-10-26 14:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025705, 732020, 51747, '<td valign="top">This looks like a painting. I struggle with these images that look less like a photo than a piece of digital art. It is nice to look at and it meets the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a painting. I struggle with these images that look less like a photo than a piece of digital art. It is nice to look at and it meets the challenge.', '2008-10-26 14:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025706, 731662, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset pic. I would have scored it higher if there was a little more emphasis on ''wildlife''.</td>', 'Very nice sunset pic. I would have scored it higher if there was a little more emphasis on ''wildlife''.', '2008-10-26 14:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025710, 732135, 51747, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. I just noticed that the goat has only 2 feet in contact with the rock. They are amazing!</td>', 'Awesome capture. I just noticed that the goat has only 2 feet in contact with the rock. They are amazing!', '2008-10-26 14:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025712, 732015, 51747, '<td valign="top">I think it would have looked better without the green tint. It''s an awesome shot!</td>', 'I think it would have looked better without the green tint. It''s an awesome shot!', '2008-10-26 14:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025713, 732205, 51747, '<td valign="top">About as vivid as it gets. Just a bit soft and a little overexposed.</td>', 'About as vivid as it gets. Just a bit soft and a little overexposed.', '2008-10-26 14:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025715, 731878, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice focus. The blurred background and the border both add to the image.</td>', 'Nice focus. The blurred background and the border both add to the image.', '2008-10-26 14:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025716, 731329, 51747, '<td valign="top">That is a seriously ugly animal!</td>', 'That is a seriously ugly animal!', '2008-10-26 14:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025717, 732117, 51747, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen an owl with ''red-eye''. See if you can get this same bird without flash the next time.</td>', 'I''ve never seen an owl with ''red-eye''. See if you can get this same bird without flash the next time.', '2008-10-26 14:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025718, 732277, 51747, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little less wood in the image wood make these Starlings more prominent  :)</td>', 'Maybe a little less wood in the image wood make these Starlings more prominent  :)', '2008-10-26 14:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025719, 732264, 51747, '<td valign="top">Well, It''s a bit of a stretch</td>', 'Well, It''s a bit of a stretch', '2008-10-26 14:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025721, 732220, 51747, '<td valign="top">Pretty clear image. I find it hard to get shots like this.</td>', 'Pretty clear image. I find it hard to get shots like this.', '2008-10-26 14:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025722, 732262, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp</td>', 'Nice and sharp', '2008-10-26 14:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025723, 731868, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the subject.</td>', 'Nice framing of the subject.', '2008-10-26 14:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025724, 732270, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice focus. May be a bit over exposed. The background is distracting.</td>', 'Nice focus. May be a bit over exposed. The background is distracting.', '2008-10-26 14:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025725, 732072, 51747, '<td valign="top">Could it be a young Caribou?</td>', 'Could it be a young Caribou?', '2008-10-26 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025727, 732214, 51747, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a surprise photo.</td>', 'Not bad for a surprise photo.', '2008-10-26 14:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025729, 732294, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice light around the eye.</td>', 'Nice light around the eye.', '2008-10-26 14:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025732, 732016, 51747, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo. I thought insects were not part of this challenge?</td>', 'It''s a nice photo. I thought insects were not part of this challenge?', '2008-10-26 14:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025734, 731533, 51747, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more in focus.</td>', 'I would like to see more in focus.', '2008-10-26 14:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025738, 732233, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful image. I might have cropped a bit off the left. Just my 2 cents.</td>', 'Nice colorful image. I might have cropped a bit off the left. Just my 2 cents.', '2008-10-26 14:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025744, 731942, 51747, '<td valign="top">Just a little soft. A nice image otherwise.</td>', 'Just a little soft. A nice image otherwise.', '2008-10-26 14:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025748, 732299, 51747, '<td valign="top">Amazingly colorful Mandarin Duck. The light is just a bit harsh and takes away from the image. IMHO Focus is nice and sharp.</td>', 'Amazingly colorful Mandarin Duck. The light is just a bit harsh and takes away from the image. IMHO Focus is nice and sharp.', '2008-10-26 14:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025750, 732150, 51747, '<td valign="top">The coloring is nice but it looks like he has a tree growing out of his head.</td>', 'The coloring is nice but it looks like he has a tree growing out of his head.', '2008-10-26 14:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025753, 730892, 51747, '<td valign="top">Funny title.</td>', 'Funny title.', '2008-10-26 14:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025754, 731728, 51747, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful bird. Just a tad too much saturation for me.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful bird. Just a tad too much saturation for me.', '2008-10-26 14:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025756, 731882, 51747, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice capture. Just a little soft.</td>', 'Pretty nice capture. Just a little soft.', '2008-10-26 15:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025768, 732203, 52549, '<td valign="top">What a capture! Excellent.</td>', 'What a capture! Excellent.', '2008-10-26 15:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5025769, 731759, 52549, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting. Really wonderful.</td>', 'Looks like a painting. Really wonderful.', '2008-10-26 15:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
