(5026036, 732153, 83416, '<td valign="top">Like the human expression in this portrait shot  believe should do very well in the challenge!!!</td>', 'Like the human expression in this portrait shot  believe should do very well in the challenge!!!', '2008-10-26 20:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026041, 732270, 83416, '<td valign="top">Great shot (its looking right at you), which I think will do quite nicely in the challenge  I personally would have tried playing around with various crops  somehow I want the animals eyes to be higher in the frame.</td>', 'Great shot (its looking right at you), which I think will do quite nicely in the challenge  I personally would have tried playing around with various crops  somehow I want the animals eyes to be higher in the frame.', '2008-10-26 20:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026042, 732286, 83416, '<td valign="top">Love the tranquility here.</td>', 'Love the tranquility here.', '2008-10-26 20:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026045, 732186, 83416, '<td valign="top">Wow! It must have taken a while to stalk this one out  great shot and wish you luck! Only comment  there appears to be a slight blue tint  or maybe its time to calibrate my monitor again :D</td>', 'Wow! It must have taken a while to stalk this one out  great shot and wish you luck! Only comment  there appears to be a slight blue tint  or maybe its time to calibrate my monitor again :D', '2008-10-26 20:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026048, 732150, 83416, '<td valign="top">Like the monochromatic colors in this shot. Its somewhat a pity the animal has eyes closed. Should do well anyway. Good luck!</td>', 'Like the monochromatic colors in this shot. Its somewhat a pity the animal has eyes closed. Should do well anyway. Good luck!', '2008-10-26 20:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026054, 731886, 12076, '<td valign="top">This works well in B&amp;W.  Nice shot.</td>', 'This works well in B&W.  Nice shot.', '2008-10-26 20:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026056, 731548, 12076, '<td valign="top">Well done. Shows the essence of life in the wild.  I think the colors are all too similar and the heron and frog don''t stand out well enough.  I don''t know how this could have been avoided though.</td>', 'Well done. Shows the essence of life in the wild.  I think the colors are all too similar and the heron and frog don''t stand out well enough.  I don''t know how this could have been avoided though.', '2008-10-26 20:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026058, 732153, 26878, '<td valign="top">Oh do you?</td>', 'Oh do you?', '2008-10-26 20:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026059, 732101, 12076, '<td valign="top">Cute expression. The background colors work well with this animal.</td>', 'Cute expression. The background colors work well with this animal.', '2008-10-26 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026060, 731651, 12076, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Expression is intriguing.  The white streak at the top is a minor distraction.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Expression is intriguing.  The white streak at the top is a minor distraction.', '2008-10-26 20:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026061, 732020, 12076, '<td valign="top">The water is perfect in this shot.  I can''t think of ny improvements.  Nice.</td>', 'The water is perfect in this shot.  I can''t think of ny improvements.  Nice.', '2008-10-26 20:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026063, 732186, 12076, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  The white spots (sky) showing through the leaves are a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'I like this alot.  The white spots (sky) showing through the leaves are a bit of a distraction.', '2008-10-26 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026065, 731582, 12076, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The angle and background are just right.  Had to bump up your score the second time I looked at this.</td>', 'Excellent.  The angle and background are just right.  Had to bump up your score the second time I looked at this.', '2008-10-26 20:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026066, 731548, 26878, '<td valign="top">Great timing</td>', 'Great timing', '2008-10-26 20:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026069, 732252, 26878, '<td valign="top">longest title ever, lol</td>', 'longest title ever, lol', '2008-10-26 20:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026071, 732220, 12076, '<td valign="top">Uhmm...  I will always score fish pictures high because that is a greater passion than photography for me.  This is really good though.  Would the weeds have been greener earlier in the year?  Needs just a bit more color.  Nice.</td>', 'Uhmm...  I will always score fish pictures high because that is a greater passion than photography for me.  This is really good though.  Would the weeds have been greener earlier in the year?  Needs just a bit more color.  Nice.', '2008-10-26 20:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026072, 730790, 12076, '<td valign="top">Great shot and DOF.  Bumping it up a point after looking at it several times.</td>', 'Great shot and DOF.  Bumping it up a point after looking at it several times.', '2008-10-26 20:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026073, 732153, 12076, '<td valign="top">I think he thinks you look silly.  Well composed and I like it.  The index finger is a little blurred and that is a tiny distraction for me.</td>', 'I think he thinks you look silly.  Well composed and I like it.  The index finger is a little blurred and that is a tiny distraction for me.', '2008-10-26 20:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026074, 732122, 12076, '<td valign="top">Great color, DOF and composition.</td>', 'Great color, DOF and composition.', '2008-10-26 20:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026112, 732108, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love that the only direct light in the enclosure is shining on his face. The dimmer light also helps mask the glass. He''s a beautiful bird, though he looks kinda like he''s scowling at you!</td>', 'I love that the only direct light in the enclosure is shining on his face. The dimmer light also helps mask the glass. He''s a beautiful bird, though he looks kinda like he''s scowling at you!', '2008-10-26 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026115, 730572, 3569, '<td valign="top">winter plumaged Yellow-rumped warbler for sure</td>', 'winter plumaged Yellow-rumped warbler for sure', '2008-10-26 21:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026116, 732072, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''ve no idea what he is either but he''s got a lovely face. From the cloudiness at the sides of the photo I''d say he''s either behind glass or you''ve got a DOF setting I''m unfamiliar with; if you did shoot through glass, then well done on the really good sharpness on his face.</td>', 'I''ve no idea what he is either but he''s got a lovely face. From the cloudiness at the sides of the photo I''d say he''s either behind glass or you''ve got a DOF setting I''m unfamiliar with; if you did shoot through glass, then well done on the really good sharpness on his face.', '2008-10-26 21:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026119, 732020, 3569, '<td valign="top">dunlin for sure</td>', 'dunlin for sure', '2008-10-26 21:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026121, 732277, 3569, '<td valign="top">starlings for sure</td>', 'starlings for sure', '2008-10-26 21:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026122, 731759, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure on the processing here, everything around the stag looks to be in motion blur somehow, even the tree. I can see that that might help make the deer the focal point but personally, I''d find it more attractive if everything was more in focus. Still, he''s a beautiful animal and you''ve captured him at a great moment.</td>', 'I''m not sure on the processing here, everything around the stag looks to be in motion blur somehow, even the tree. I can see that that might help make the deer the focal point but personally, I''d find it more attractive if everything was more in focus. Still, he''s a beautiful animal and you''ve captured him at a great moment.', '2008-10-26 21:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026123, 732088, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice curve-billed thrasher</td>', 'nice curve-billed thrasher', '2008-10-26 21:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026124, 732298, 94265, '<td valign="top">I really love his expression, silly as that might sound; he looks like he''s saying, ''taking my photo, Ok but I''m having vittles, so make it quick eh?'' Heehee. Very handsome animal, I really like all the green behind him, makes a nice contrast with his beige fur.</td>', 'I really love his expression, silly as that might sound; he looks like he''s saying, ''taking my photo, Ok but I''m having vittles, so make it quick eh?'' Heehee. Very handsome animal, I really like all the green behind him, makes a nice contrast with his beige fur.', '2008-10-26 21:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026125, 731942, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d say this is softened maybe a fraction much but it''s a beautiful shot, the colours look great. I like that you''ve cropped it tight on him, no background to fuss with, just that beautiful face and patterned fur.</td>', 'I''d say this is softened maybe a fraction much but it''s a beautiful shot, the colours look great. I like that you''ve cropped it tight on him, no background to fuss with, just that beautiful face and patterned fur.', '2008-10-26 21:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026126, 732274, 94265, '<td valign="top">The one facing the camera looks really surprised, haha. Beautiful animals. The focus on them is really good and their colour is lovely.</td>', 'The one facing the camera looks really surprised, haha. Beautiful animals. The focus on them is really good and their colour is lovely.', '2008-10-26 21:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026128, 732186, 94265, '<td valign="top">He might just be having lunch but he''s beautifully majestic. Really good pose you''ve caught him at, I like that the 2 trees sort of frame him.</td>', 'He might just be having lunch but he''s beautifully majestic. Really good pose you''ve caught him at, I like that the 2 trees sort of frame him.', '2008-10-26 21:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026130, 732270, 94265, '<td valign="top">The sharpness and focus on him is excellent, you can even make out the individual hairs under his chin and the ridges on his antlers. Great job.</td>', 'The sharpness and focus on him is excellent, you can even make out the individual hairs under his chin and the ridges on his antlers. Great job.', '2008-10-26 21:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026133, 732182, 94265, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful! You couldn''t have caught her at a better moment, looking right at you and framed with the lovely yellow flowrs. Great focus too.</td>', 'She''s beautiful! You couldn''t have caught her at a better moment, looking right at you and framed with the lovely yellow flowrs. Great focus too.', '2008-10-26 21:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026134, 732163, 94265, '<td valign="top">That yellow is beautifully prominent. He looks like he''s about to take off, very majestic. Excellent focus.</td>', 'That yellow is beautifully prominent. He looks like he''s about to take off, very majestic. Excellent focus.', '2008-10-26 21:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026136, 732101, 94265, '<td valign="top">I actually said awwww out loud at this wee guy. The sharpness is really good, especially on the eyes.</td>', 'I actually said awwww out loud at this wee guy. The sharpness is really good, especially on the eyes.', '2008-10-26 21:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026138, 732144, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, such lovely colours. Good DOF.</td>', 'Very pretty, such lovely colours. Good DOF.', '2008-10-26 21:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026139, 732237, 94265, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a green halo under his chin, I''d have taken the green channel down just a little bit. Otherwise, the shot is nice and very cute!</td>', 'There seems to be a green halo under his chin, I''d have taken the green channel down just a little bit. Otherwise, the shot is nice and very cute!', '2008-10-26 21:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026141, 732149, 94265, '<td valign="top">What a lovely wee bird. Great sharpness and focus, especially round his face and wings. The little splash of yellow is great. I''d have maybe liked to have seen a little hint of something in the background rather than the block caramel colour.</td>', 'What a lovely wee bird. Great sharpness and focus, especially round his face and wings. The little splash of yellow is great. I''d have maybe liked to have seen a little hint of something in the background rather than the block caramel colour.', '2008-10-26 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026145, 732233, 94265, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a fair bit of a strange pink hue on several places in the shot but overall it''s really great; the colourful autumn trees in the background and the beautiful, fearless stag. Nice focus on him.</td>', 'There seems to be a fair bit of a strange pink hue on several places in the shot but overall it''s really great; the colourful autumn trees in the background and the beautiful, fearless stag. Nice focus on him.', '2008-10-26 21:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026148, 731838, 94265, '<td valign="top">He''s gorgeous and really looks like he''s smiling! You can really see their power in this shot, with those huge antlers and the bulk around his neck but there''s also the nice juxtaposition happening with his friendly face.</td>', 'He''s gorgeous and really looks like he''s smiling! You can really see their power in this shot, with those huge antlers and the bulk around his neck but there''s also the nice juxtaposition happening with his friendly face.', '2008-10-26 21:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026151, 732279, 94265, '<td valign="top">The bright blue rippling water looks fantastic. You''ve caught the duck at a quite unusual angle too. I like the litte flying droplets, it shows movement without the blur.</td>', 'The bright blue rippling water looks fantastic. You''ve caught the duck at a quite unusual angle too. I like the litte flying droplets, it shows movement without the blur.', '2008-10-26 21:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026155, 732010, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful little robin, the colours are lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful little robin, the colours are lovely.', '2008-10-26 21:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026156, 732037, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely and full of good feeling. The title is perfect; he''s staring right at you, challenging, almost daring you to come near his does.</td>', 'This is really lovely and full of good feeling. The title is perfect; he''s staring right at you, challenging, almost daring you to come near his does.', '2008-10-26 21:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
