(5026386, 731583, 19936, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the comments and votes.  Happy to have another new front page shot but second in a row I lost a PB.  Maybe next one!<br/> <br/>For those who asked the OOF wing was caused by the apperature setting giving so little DOF.  These guys have 5-6 foot wing spans and I did not get them al in focus.</td>', 'Thanks to all for the comments and votes.  Happy to have another new front page shot but second in a row I lost a PB.  Maybe next one! For those who asked the OOF wing was caused by the apperature setting giving so little DOF.  These guys have 5-6 foot wing spans and I did not get them al in focus.', '2008-10-27 00:38:59.000000', NULL, 0),
