(5026633, 732181, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, congratulations on the PB, and what a great score? But especially what a beautiful photo. Love the colors and DOF. And I like the point of view -- the squirrel looks very small on that big stump. I think it is good that you left the surrounding environment in the shot rather than cropping down to the squirrel. Oh, I forgot to mention how much I like the focus and texture.</td>', 'Wow, congratulations on the PB, and what a great score? But especially what a beautiful photo. Love the colors and DOF. And I like the point of view -- the squirrel looks very small on that big stump. I think it is good that you left the surrounding environment in the shot rather than cropping down to the squirrel. Oh, I forgot to mention how much I like the focus and texture.', '2008-10-27 06:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
