(5027022, 732078, 80096, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t ribbon, it''s a beautiful capture. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t ribbon, it''s a beautiful capture. Keep up the good work!', '2008-10-27 11:00:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5027036, 732247, 58728, '<td valign="top">This is one of the cutest pictures on the planet.  Congrats on your blue!  :)</td>', 'This is one of the cutest pictures on the planet.  Congrats on your blue!  :)', '2008-10-27 11:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5027039, 732036, 16531, '<td valign="top">I scored this shot at a 9 ,I was hoping it would do better to prove me wrong.  Because I had a couple shots of flying little birdies that I thought of entering but...<br/>Anyway it was good shot and I liked it and I know how hard it is to get those little fast guys in flight . <br/>You did  well .<br/>R</td>', 'I scored this shot at a 9 ,I was hoping it would do better to prove me wrong.  Because I had a couple shots of flying little birdies that I thought of entering but...Anyway it was good shot and I liked it and I know how hard it is to get those little fast guys in flight . You did  well .R', '2008-10-27 11:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5027057, 731663, 75585, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot too - congrats on a great finish especially with a subject that didn''t meet the criteria.  You fared a lot better than the shots people thought were in a zoo.</td>', 'I really liked this shot too - congrats on a great finish especially with a subject that didn''t meet the criteria.  You fared a lot better than the shots people thought were in a zoo.', '2008-10-27 11:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5027066, 732136, 30049, '<td valign="top">I quite liked this one...gave it a 7.  The colors are very nice IMO.  I like the natural earthy tones - has a nice rich feel to it. Had the sun been shining this wouldn''t feel nearly the same. Your POV also adds a lot to the comp as it somehow makes viewing this image more personal.  <br/> <br/>BTW - Do you always go after wildlife handicapped with 75mm being your long lens?  :-D  I have to say; that surprised me when I noticed it.</td>', 'I quite liked this one...gave it a 7.  The colors are very nice IMO.  I like the natural earthy tones - has a nice rich feel to it. Had the sun been shining this wouldn''t feel nearly the same. Your POV also adds a lot to the comp as it somehow makes viewing this image more personal.   BTW - Do you always go after wildlife handicapped with 75mm being your long lens?  :-D  I have to say; that surprised me when I noticed it.', '2008-10-27 11:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5027084, 732223, 3724, '<td valign="top">marvelous tight and detailed view. I like the sheen of the light on his back. a beautiful mono edit. I like your outtakes for this challenge as much. 9</td>', 'marvelous tight and detailed view. I like the sheen of the light on his back. a beautiful mono edit. I like your outtakes for this challenge as much. 9', '2008-10-27 11:37:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5027090, 732247, 91360, '<td valign="top">wow,outstanding!<br/>greate DOF!</td>', 'wow,outstanding!greate DOF!', '2008-10-27 11:43:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5027091, 732182, 30049, '<td valign="top">I smiled when I saw this during voting and it was one of my higher rated shots.  Surprised a little at where this ended up.  It was a hit for sure with those that commented on it during voting, averaging a score of 8.<br/> <br/>The editing on this is very nice.  Great detail in the original capture certainly was there.  The natural colors really pop on this.  From my seat I''m not seeing anything needing attention...wonderfully done!</td>', 'I smiled when I saw this during voting and it was one of my higher rated shots.  Surprised a little at where this ended up.  It was a hit for sure with those that commented on it during voting, averaging a score of 8. The editing on this is very nice.  Great detail in the original capture certainly was there.  The natural colors really pop on this.  From my seat I''m not seeing anything needing attention...wonderfully done!', '2008-10-27 11:44:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5027092, 731878, 91360, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon, Jason. Terrific capture.<br/>WOW AGAIN!</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon, Jason. Terrific capture.WOW AGAIN!', '2008-10-27 11:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
