(5027203, 732015, 30049, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=733277" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/90502/120/733277.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/90502/120/733277.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/90502/120/733277.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>MUCH better!!!  Even though I wouldn''t have scored it too high because it''s a zoo shot it still would have pushed a 5.75-6.0 without the green color cast.<br/> <br/></td>', '  MUCH better!!!  Even though I wouldn''t have scored it too high because it''s a zoo shot it still would have pushed a 5.75-6.0 without the green color cast. ', '2008-10-27 12:56:19.000000', NULL, 0),
