(5027263, 730790, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>wonderful in every way--tonal choices, dof, subject, composition<br/>the oof nose, which troubled you, seems to me to suggest a bit of motion, instead, almost as if s/he is <i>speaking</i> :-)</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!wonderful in every way--tonal choices, dof, subject, compositionthe oof nose, which troubled you, seems to me to suggest a bit of motion, instead, almost as if s/he is speaking :-)', '2008-10-27 13:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
