(5028337, 732266, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wow, you were robbed. And when those robbers finished robbing, some more came to rob you again. Flip :(<br/> <br/>Anyways, just thought I''d swing by and let you know I thought this was wonderful. I too imagined the bird to be standing on a dead sunflower, giving the illusion that he is somehow miniaturised. Or perhaps the bird is alone on an alien world where plants are gigantic.<br/> <br/>Beautiful.</td>', 'Wow, you were robbed. And when those robbers finished robbing, some more came to rob you again. Flip :( Anyways, just thought I''d swing by and let you know I thought this was wonderful. I too imagined the bird to be standing on a dead sunflower, giving the illusion that he is somehow miniaturised. Or perhaps the bird is alone on an alien world where plants are gigantic. Beautiful.', '2008-10-28 00:04:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5028340, 730790, 36371, '<td valign="top">OOOO I love this. Quit nitpicking about the OOF nose.<br/>this is fabulous! I love the little paws curled under at the chest.<br/>Great catch!<br/>(Imagine what he would have done for food!!)</td>', 'OOOO I love this. Quit nitpicking about the OOF nose.this is fabulous! I love the little paws curled under at the chest.Great catch!(Imagine what he would have done for food!!)', '2008-10-28 00:07:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5028373, 731727, 54645, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cujee:</b></div><hr/><i> this should''ve won the blue. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, but that gull shot is something special.</td>', 'Originally posted by cujee: this should''ve won the blue.   Thanks, but that gull shot is something special.', '2008-10-28 00:34:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5028376, 732274, 45475, '<td valign="top">Hi Scott, it is a lovely shot - "cutesy" I''d say :)<br/> <br/>A few issues I had with it though, are: underexposure, possible incorrect white balance (the whites look blue), noise in the shadows, and not getting the "tiger fight" feel at all due to the angle and tight crop.<br/> <br/>Some things to keep in mind: play with your white balance and really look at the changes it makes to your photograph - Set to Cloudy will ''warm'' up images, and set to Sunny will ''cool''; experiment with different angles - low down looking upward or at eye level with your subject will give it an extra something, and a wider crop (particularly in this instance) will help viewers understand the complete story when there is one you want to tell.<br/> <br/>If you really want critique as opposed to comments, best to post in the forums afterward or ask for a Critique Club comment when submitting to a challenge.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps!</td>', 'Hi Scott, it is a lovely shot - "cutesy" I''d say :) A few issues I had with it though, are: underexposure, possible incorrect white balance (the whites look blue), noise in the shadows, and not getting the "tiger fight" feel at all due to the angle and tight crop. Some things to keep in mind: play with your white balance and really look at the changes it makes to your photograph - Set to Cloudy will ''warm'' up images, and set to Sunny will ''cool''; experiment with different angles - low down looking upward or at eye level with your subject will give it an extra something, and a wider crop (particularly in this instance) will help viewers understand the complete story when there is one you want to tell. If you really want critique as opposed to comments, best to post in the forums afterward or ask for a Critique Club comment when submitting to a challenge. Hope this helps!', '2008-10-28 00:35:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5028386, 732186, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very nice Barry. Congrats on your top 10 shot!</td>', 'Very nice Barry. Congrats on your top 10 shot!', '2008-10-28 00:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
