(5028998, 732268, 59029, '<td valign="top">I have to agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=68586" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jedusi</a> in terms of cropping the pic, but otherwise would leave this shot as is.  Nice clear shot, majestic subject, good lighting and colours.</td>', 'I have to agree with  Jedusi in terms of cropping the pic, but otherwise would leave this shot as is.  Nice clear shot, majestic subject, good lighting and colours.', '2008-10-28 12:28:31.000000', NULL, 0),
