(5032068, 731663, 45475, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rinac:</b></div><hr/><i> I wonder why so many people think insects are not animals, let alone wildlife??? In any event, this was one of my top picks, congratulations on a fine finish! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t think many would argue with you in general but this challenge was pretty clear on it if you read the challenge description. Regardless, DPC should just get rid of the descriptions. Nobody reads them anyway. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I took the challenge description to be giving an example of wildlife, not to mean only those species specifically listed.<br/> <br/>Well I guess that rules out fish too huh, since they''re also animals not mentioned in the description?</td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Originally posted by rinac: I wonder why so many people think insects are not animals, let alone wildlife??? In any event, this was one of my top picks, congratulations on a fine finish!   I don''t think many would argue with you in general but this challenge was pretty clear on it if you read the challenge description. Regardless, DPC should just get rid of the descriptions. Nobody reads them anyway.   I took the challenge description to be giving an example of wildlife, not to mean only those species specifically listed. Well I guess that rules out fish too huh, since they''re also animals not mentioned in the description?', '2008-10-29 21:59:20.000000', NULL, 0),
