(5049377, 732015, 3087, '<td valign="top">Goodness, yes, in answer to your comment box, the green is VIVID. Can you see if when you view the image from another monitor? We''re not talking subtle here, it''s dayglo! :)<br/> <br/>I like the natural colour though processing makes it seem kind of soft focus and the close-up doesn''t really speak wild to me, it shouts zoo zoo zoo!<br/> <br/>But BIG improvement on the green!<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'Goodness, yes, in answer to your comment box, the green is VIVID. Can you see if when you view the image from another monitor? We''re not talking subtle here, it''s dayglo! :) I like the natural colour though processing makes it seem kind of soft focus and the close-up doesn''t really speak wild to me, it shouts zoo zoo zoo! But BIG improvement on the green! :)', '2008-11-06 18:22:36.000000', NULL, 0),
