(5063532, 731765, 30982, '<td valign="top">You got a 7 from me on this.  I liked him in his element, and there was something about the pose I thought was rather regal.</td>', 'You got a 7 from me on this.  I liked him in his element, and there was something about the pose I thought was rather regal.', '2008-11-14 12:27:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5081019, 732062, 67841, '<td valign="top">It''s so easy for people to assume certain things about a photo without knowing the full story.  As a wildlife shot the photo is really good.  As a wildlife shot NOT IN A ZOO with a story like you have the photo is great.  Given your obvious post skills, I''m surprised you didn''t do some more adjustments to this, though.  I think a little more color + some slightly deeper blacks would have ratcheted this up a bit as far as DPC goes.  <br/> <br/>LOL, what a funny story...</td>', 'It''s so easy for people to assume certain things about a photo without knowing the full story.  As a wildlife shot the photo is really good.  As a wildlife shot NOT IN A ZOO with a story like you have the photo is great.  Given your obvious post skills, I''m surprised you didn''t do some more adjustments to this, though.  I think a little more color + some slightly deeper blacks would have ratcheted this up a bit as far as DPC goes.   LOL, what a funny story...', '2008-11-24 02:12:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5083009, 731765, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is amazing .. love the point of view and the incredible detail you''ve captured in your shot .. particularly love the nearly translucent nostrils and the amazing clarity in the eye .. :)</td>', 'this is amazing .. love the point of view and the incredible detail you''ve captured in your shot .. particularly love the nearly translucent nostrils and the amazing clarity in the eye .. :)', '2008-11-25 01:23:01.000000', NULL, 0),
