(5128006, 731928, 674, '<td valign="top">A rather belated comment and suggestion! I think this is a great image but a bit dark, I have found that shooting birds and wildlife an iso of 200 or higher is better! since I started doing it my pics are much sharper.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-12 23:11:44.</i></td>', 'A rather belated comment and suggestion! I think this is a great image but a bit dark, I have found that shooting birds and wildlife an iso of 200 or higher is better! since I started doing it my pics are much sharper.', '2008-12-12 23:11:19.000000', '2008-12-12 23:11:44.000000', 0),
