(6880806, 732247, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love to come across old pictures on DPC and this is a beaut!  Adore everything about it, and am delighted it won the challenge. Congrats, so well deserved. Would love to know how you managed the shot. I''m guessing from your lens and the shallow dof that you were a ways away...?</td>', 'I love to come across old pictures on DPC and this is a beaut!  Adore everything about it, and am delighted it won the challenge. Congrats, so well deserved. Would love to know how you managed the shot. I''m guessing from your lens and the shallow dof that you were a ways away...?', '2012-10-11 03:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7069478, 732247, 91360, '<td valign="top">funny how I came back to this shot..just traveling around the site to look for new challenges, and boom! i realized that this image impact me so much, that every time I think of taking an image, I try to look for the leader :)<br/> <br/>amazing capture and most of all one you can''t forget.</td>', 'funny how I came back to this shot..just traveling around the site to look for new challenges, and boom! i realized that this image impact me so much, that every time I think of taking an image, I try to look for the leader :) amazing capture and most of all one you can''t forget.', '2013-07-13 18:47:37.000000', NULL, 0);
